msgid ""
"Company drivers bill the carrier, owner-operators pay the regional diesel "
"price."
msgstr "公司司机记承运商账，车主司机按地区柴油价格付钱。"

msgid "Company drivers bill the carrier, owner-operators pay the shop."
msgstr "公司司机记承运商账，车主司机付钱给修理厂。"

msgid ""
"Worn tires grip less. Company drivers bill the carrier, owner-operators pay "
"the shop."
msgstr "磨损的轮胎抓地力更差。公司司机记承运商账，车主司机付钱给修理厂。"

msgid ""
"Winter tires bite harder on snow and ice, wear faster, and grip a little "
"less on warm dry pavement."
msgstr "冬季胎在冰雪路面抓地更牢，磨损更快，在温暖干燥的路面上抓地力稍差一点。"

msgid ""
"A chain set is seven chains: four for the drive tires, one for a trailer "
"tire, and two spares, the most any state here asks of a semi, plus two "
"repair links. Put chains on from the pause menu once you're stopped in snow "
"or ice. They wear out fast on bare pavement. Company drivers bill the "
"carrier."
msgstr ""
"一套链条由七根链条组成：四根用于驱动轮胎，一根用于拖车轮胎，还有两个备用链，这里大多数州都要求半挂链，再加上两个维修链节。一旦你在雪或冰中停下来，请从暂"
"停菜单中安装防滑链。它们在无冰雪路面上磨损得很快。公司司机向承运人收取费用。"

msgid ""
"Worn shoes pull weaker and fade sooner. The engine brake costs them "
"nothing. Company drivers bill the carrier, owner-operators pay the shop."
msgstr "磨损的刹车片制动力更弱，也更快衰退。发动机制动不会磨损它们。公司司机记承运商账，车主司机付钱给修理厂。"

msgid ""
"A worn engine is down on power and burns more fuel. Over-revving and "
"lugging wear it fast. Company drivers bill the carrier, owner-operators pay "
"the shop."
msgstr "磨损的发动机动力不足，油耗更高。转速过高和低速拖档都会让它磨损得很快。公司司机记承运商账，车主司机付钱给修理厂。"

msgid "Company drivers bill the carrier, owner-operators pay."
msgstr "公司司机记承运商账，车主司机自己付钱。"

