#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Press {current} again to keep it."
msgstr "再按一次{current}就保留它。"

#. placeholders: {label}, {now}
msgid "{label} is now {now}."
msgstr "{label}现在是{now}。"

#. placeholders: {current}
msgid "Kept {current}."
msgstr "保留了{current}。"

#. placeholders: {current}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Press another, or keep {current} with Escape."
msgstr "请按另一个，或者按Escape保留{current}。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {label}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{sentence_start} is already {label}."
msgstr "{sentence_start}已经是{label}了。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {label}, {current}
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} is already {label}. Press another, or keep {current} with "
"Escape."
msgstr "{sentence_start}已经是{label}了。请按另一个，或者按Escape保留{current}。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {current}
msgid "{sentence_start}. Press another, or keep {current} with Escape."
msgstr "{sentence_start}。请按另一个，或者按Escape保留{current}。"

msgid "Every keyboard shortcut is back to its default."
msgstr "所有快捷键都已恢复默认。"

msgid "Every controller button is back to its default."
msgstr "所有手柄按键都已恢复默认。"

msgid ""
"Enter, then press the key you want for this control. Escape keeps the one "
"it has."
msgstr "按Enter，然后按你想给这个控制项用的键。按Escape保留原来的键。"

msgid ""
"Enter, then press the button you want for this control, with the right "
"bumper held for the second layer."
msgstr "按Enter，然后按你想给这个控制项用的按键，按住right bumper可设置第二层。"

msgid "Reset every keyboard shortcut to its default"
msgstr "把所有快捷键恢复默认"

msgid "Reset every controller button to its default"
msgstr "把所有手柄按键恢复默认"

msgid "Puts every control on this screen back where it started."
msgstr "把这个界面上的每个控制项都恢复到最初的位置。"

msgid ""
"Move up and down to pick a gesture, then confirm it to choose the command "
"it runs while driving. Go back to leave."
msgstr "上下移动选择一个手势，然后确认，选择它在驾驶时执行的命令。返回即可离开。"

msgid "Gesture"
msgstr "手势"

msgid "Every touch gesture is back to its default."
msgstr "所有触摸手势都已恢复默认。"

msgid "Touch haptics enabled."
msgstr "触摸震动反馈已启用。"

msgid "Touch haptics disabled."
msgstr "触摸震动反馈已禁用。"

msgid "Confirm, then choose the command this gesture runs while driving."
msgstr "确认，然后选择这个手势在驾驶时执行的命令。"

msgid "Practice gestures"
msgstr "练习手势"

msgid ""
"Names each gesture and its current command without controlling the truck."
msgstr "说出每个手势和它当前的命令，但不会控制卡车。"

#. placeholders: {else}
msgid "Touch haptics: {else}"
msgstr "触摸震动反馈：{else}"

msgid ""
"Light feedback confirms pedals and commands. Emergency braking warns."
msgstr "轻微的震动确认踏板和命令。紧急制动时会发出警告震动。"

msgid "Reset every touch gesture to its default"
msgstr "把所有触摸手势恢复默认"

msgid "Puts every gesture on this screen back where it started."
msgstr "把这个界面上的每个手势都恢复到最初的设置。"

msgid ""
"Move up and down to pick a command and confirm to put it on the gesture. "
"Going back keeps the one it has."
msgstr "上下移动选择一个命令，确认后把它放到这个手势上。返回会保留原来的命令。"

#. placeholders: {gesture_name}, {label}
msgid "{gesture_name} now runs {label}."
msgstr "{gesture_name}现在执行{label}。"

msgid "Swipe up and hold: gas. Lift to coast."
msgstr "向上滑动并按住：油门。抬起手指就滑行。"

msgid "Swipe down and hold: brake."
msgstr "向下滑动并按住：刹车。"

msgid "Swipe left and hold: steer left."
msgstr "向左滑动并按住：向左转向。"

msgid "Swipe right and hold: steer right."
msgstr "向右滑动并按住：向右转向。"

msgid "Deep swipe down: emergency brake, or the parking brake when stopped."
msgstr "向下深滑：紧急制动，停车时则是驻车制动。"

msgid "Hold still: straighten the wheel."
msgstr "按住不动：回正方向盘。"

msgid "Emergency brake."
msgstr "紧急制动。"

msgid "Two-finger hold: horn."
msgstr "双指按住：喇叭。"

msgid "Two-finger turn right: start the engine."
msgstr "双指向右旋转：启动发动机。"

msgid "Two-finger turn left: stop the engine."
msgstr "双指向左旋转：关闭发动机。"

msgid "Second finger, hold left: steer left."
msgstr "第二根手指，按住左侧：向左转向。"

msgid "Second finger, hold right: steer right."
msgstr "第二根手指，按住右侧：向右转向。"

msgid "Practice touch gestures?"
msgstr "要练习触摸手势吗？"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Before your first drive, practice the touch gestures?"
msgstr "第一次驾驶之前，要练习一下触摸手势吗？"

#. placeholders: {current_text}
msgid ""
"Before your first drive, practice the touch gestures? Practice names each "
"gesture without moving the truck. {current_text}"
msgstr "第一次驾驶之前，要练习一下触摸手势吗？练习会说出每个手势，但不会让卡车移动。{current_text}"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Practice names each gesture without moving the truck."
msgstr "练习会说出每个手势，但不会让卡车移动。"

msgid "Skip and start driving"
msgstr "跳过，开始驾驶"

msgid "Swipe down with two fingers twice within two seconds to leave."
msgstr "在两秒内用两根手指向下滑动两次即可离开。"

msgid "Escape twice within two seconds to leave."
msgstr "在两秒内按两次Escape即可离开。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "A flick is one step."
msgstr "轻扫一次是一步。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "A swipe and hold is continuous."
msgstr "滑动并按住是连续的。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Gestures are named but do not control the truck."
msgstr "手势会被说出来，但不会控制卡车。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Practice gestures."
msgstr "练习手势。"

#. placeholders: {leave}
msgid ""
"Practice gestures. A flick is one step. A swipe and hold is continuous. Try "
"a flick up, then swipe up and hold. Gestures are named but do not control "
"the truck. {leave}"
msgstr "练习手势。轻扫一次是一步。滑动并按住是连续的。先试试向上轻扫，再向上滑动并按住。手势会被说出来，但不会控制卡车。{leave}"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Try a flick up, then swipe up and hold."
msgstr "先试试向上轻扫，再向上滑动并按住。"

msgid "Leaving gesture practice."
msgstr "正在离开手势练习。"

msgid "Again to leave practice."
msgstr "再来一次即可离开练习。"

msgid "Double tap"
msgstr "双击"

msgid "Swipe up"
msgstr "向上滑动"

msgid "Swipe down"
msgstr "向下滑动"

msgid "Flick left"
msgstr "向左轻扫"

msgid "Flick right"
msgstr "向右轻扫"

msgid "Magic tap"
msgstr "Magic tap"

msgid "Two-finger swipe up"
msgstr "双指向上滑动"

msgid "Two-finger swipe left"
msgstr "双指向左滑动"

msgid "Two-finger swipe right"
msgstr "双指向右滑动"

msgid "Three-finger tap"
msgstr "三指轻点"

msgid "Three-finger swipe left"
msgstr "三指向左滑动"

msgid "Three-finger swipe right"
msgstr "三指向右滑动"

msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "确认"

msgid "Change lanes left"
msgstr "向左变道"

msgid "Change lanes right"
msgstr "向右变道"

msgid "Move up"
msgstr "上移"

msgid "Move down"
msgstr "下移"

msgid "Help"
msgstr "帮助"

msgid "Previous message"
msgstr "上一条消息"

msgid "Next message"
msgstr "下一条消息"

msgid "Driving command list"
msgstr "驾驶命令列表"

msgid "No command"
msgstr "无命令"

msgid "Career start"
msgstr "职业生涯起步"

msgid ""
"Company starts use assigned carrier equipment; the carrier pays fuel, "
"repairs, insurance, and trailer support. The owner-operator start is higher "
"risk: you own a brand-new truck and pay business costs from day one. Enter "
"selects, Escape goes back."
msgstr ""
"公司司机起步使用承运商分配的设备；承运商负责燃油、维修、保险和挂车支持。车主司机起步风险更高：你拥有一辆全新的卡车，从第一天起就要支付经营成本。Ente"
"r选择，Escape返回。"

msgid "Career start."
msgstr "职业生涯起步。"

msgid "Home region"
msgstr "所在地区"

msgid ""
"Up and Down, Home and End, or a typed letter pick a region. Enter opens its "
"cities, Escape goes back."
msgstr "用Up和Down、Home和End，或输入一个字母来选择地区。Enter打开该地区的城市，Escape返回。"

#. placeholders: {carrier_name}
msgid "Home region for your {carrier_name} career."
msgstr "你在{carrier_name}的职业生涯所在地区。"

#. placeholders: {place}
msgid "{place} (1 city)"
msgstr "{place}（1个城市）"

#. placeholders: {place}
msgid "{place}, 1 city."
msgstr "{place}，1个城市。"

#. placeholders: {place}, {count}
msgid "{place} ({count} cities)"
msgstr "{place}（{count}个城市）"

#. placeholders: {place}, {count}
msgid "{place}, {count} cities."
msgstr "{place}，{count}个城市。"

msgid "Home terminal"
msgstr "基地"

msgid ""
"Up and Down, Home and End, or a typed letter pick a city. Enter confirms "
"your home terminal, Escape goes back."
msgstr "用Up和Down、Home和End，或输入一个字母来选择城市。Enter确认你的基地，Escape返回。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Escape goes back to change it."
msgstr "按Escape返回去修改。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"That save stays as it is, so this career needs a different driver name."
msgstr "那个存档会保持原样，所以这段职业生涯需要换一个司机名字。"

#. placeholders: {name}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"There is already a career named {name} from an earlier version of Freight "
"Fate."
msgstr "已经有一段名为{name}的职业生涯，来自Freight Fate的早期版本。"

#. placeholders: {name}
msgid ""
"There is already a career named {name} from an earlier version of Freight "
"Fate. That save stays as it is, so this career needs a different driver "
"name. Escape goes back to change it."
msgstr ""
"已经有一段名为{name}的职业生涯，来自Freight "
"Fate的早期版本。那个存档会保持原样，所以这段职业生涯需要换一个司机名字。按Escape返回去修改。"

#. placeholders: {name}
msgid "Loaded over existing driver named {name}. "
msgstr "已覆盖载入名为{name}的现有司机。 "

#. placeholders: {region}
msgid "{region} terminals."
msgstr "{region} 端子。"

#. placeholders: {terminal_name}, {place}
msgid "Start at {terminal_name} in {place}."
msgstr "从{place}的{terminal_name}起步。"

msgid "Main menu"
msgstr "主菜单"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Freight Fate. Start a trucking career, learn the road sounds, "
"and choose the work you want to haul."
msgstr "欢迎来到Freight Fate。开始一段卡车职业生涯，学习道路声音，选择你想拉的活儿。"

msgid ""
"Choose New career to create a driver. Before starting, you can explore the "
"help, sounds, and settings."
msgstr "选择“新的职业生涯”来创建司机。开始之前，你可以先看看帮助、声音和设置。"

msgid ""
"How to play is this guide. Learn game sounds lets you hear a road cue and "
"learn what it means."
msgstr "“玩法说明”就是这份指南。“学习游戏声音”让你听一个道路提示音并了解它的含义。"

msgid ""
"Settings lets you change driving assistance, sound, speech, and controls. "
"Report a problem opens the bug-report page in your browser. Quit closes the "
"game."
msgstr "“设置”可以更改驾驶辅助、声音、语音和操作。“报告问题”会在浏览器中打开错误报告页面。“退出”会关闭游戏。"

msgid ""
"Achievements lets you review a saved driver's earned and locked "
"achievements. With no saved careers, there is no record to review yet."
msgstr "“成就”可以查看某个已保存司机已获得和未解锁的成就。如果还没有保存的职业生涯，就还没有记录可看。"

msgid ""
"Online brings together driver profiles, account achievements, sharing, and "
"private cloud backups."
msgstr "“在线”汇集了司机主页、账户成就、分享和私人云备份。"

msgid ""
"Once you have a saved career, Continue latest career returns to your newest "
"saved trip. Choose career lets you select another driver."
msgstr "有了已保存的职业生涯后，“继续最近的职业生涯”会回到你最新保存的行程。“选择职业生涯”可以选择另一位司机。"

msgid ""
"Manage careers offers reset and deletion. The game asks you to confirm "
"before either happens."
msgstr "“管理职业生涯”提供重置和删除。两者执行之前，游戏都会请你确认。"

msgid "Your first delivery"
msgstr "你的第一次送货"

msgid ""
"Choose New career, enter a name, then choose your start and home terminal."
msgstr "选择“新的职业生涯”，输入名字，然后选择起步方式和基地。"

msgid ""
"A company driver uses carrier equipment. An owner-operator owns the truck "
"and pays its operating costs. Both begin at level one."
msgstr "公司司机使用承运商的设备。车主司机拥有卡车，并支付它的运营成本。两者都从1级开始。"

msgid ""
"Read the first-day briefing at the terminal, then open dispatch and accept "
"a load."
msgstr "在场站阅读第一天简报，然后打开调度，接受一单货物。"

msgid ""
"You first drive to the shipper without cargo. Stop at the gate, check in, "
"and load or hook the trailer."
msgstr "你先空车开到发货方。在大门停下，登记，然后装货或挂上挂车。"

msgid ""
"Company drivers follow dispatch's route. Owner-operators choose a route "
"after loading."
msgstr "公司司机按调度的路线走。车主司机在装货后自己选择路线。"

msgid ""
"Deliver before the deadline and keep the cargo undamaged. At the receiver, "
"stop and choose Dock and deliver."
msgstr "在截止时间前送达，并保证货物没有损坏。到了收货方，停车并选择“靠装卸口交付”。"

msgid ""
"Read settlement, then continue from the destination terminal. Career plan "
"explains the next step as you gain experience."
msgstr "阅读结算，然后从目的地的场站继续。随着你积累经验，“职业规划”会说明下一步。"

msgid ""
"For a first drive, All assists handles steering while you learn the sounds. "
"Change it under Settings, Gameplay, Driving assistance."
msgstr "第一次驾驶时，全部辅助会负责转向，让你专心学习声音。可以在设置、游戏玩法、驾驶辅助里更改。"

msgid "Menus and message review"
msgstr "菜单和消息回顾"

msgid ""
"Up and Down choose an option. Enter or Space selects it; Escape returns. "
"Home and End jump to the first or last option."
msgstr "Up和Down选择选项。Enter或Space选中；Escape返回。Home和End跳到第一个或最后一个选项。"

msgid ""
"Type a letter to find an option starting with it. F1 explains the selected "
"option."
msgstr "输入一个字母，找到以它开头的选项。F1解释当前选中的选项。"

msgid ""
"Comma repeats the latest message, then steps backward. Period moves "
"forward. Control with either jumps to the oldest or newest message."
msgstr "逗号重复最新的消息，再按就往前翻。句号往后翻。和Control一起按，就跳到最早或最新的消息。"

msgid ""
"The brackets choose all, general, or driving messages. Control C copies the "
"selected message. Control Shift C copies the last thing the game said. "
"Review keys type normally inside text fields."
msgstr ""
"方括号键选择全部、常规或驾驶消息。Control C复制选中的消息。Control Shift "
"C复制游戏最后说的一句话。在文本框里，消息回顾的按键照常输入文字。"

msgid ""
"In How to play, Left and Right or the Page keys change pages. Up and Down "
"let you read a little at a time. Enter or Space reads the page; either "
"Control key or F1 stops speech."
msgstr ""
"在“玩法说明”里，Left和Right或Page键翻页。Up和Down让你一次读一小段。Enter或Space朗读整页；任意一个Control键或F1停"
"止朗读。"

msgid ""
"Learn game sounds plays road cues and explains their meaning. It is "
"available on the main and pause menus."
msgstr "“学习游戏声音”播放道路提示音并解释它们的含义。主菜单和暂停菜单上都有。"

msgid ""
"Practice keys and buttons names what each key or controller button does "
"while driving, without moving the truck. Shift F1 opens it from any screen, "
"as does holding Back and pressing Start on a controller. It is also on the "
"main and pause menus. Press Escape or Start twice to leave."
msgstr ""
"练习按键和按钮会说出驾驶时每个按键或手柄按钮的作用，而不会移动卡车。在任何界面按 Shift F1 即可打开，在手柄上按住 Back 再按 Start "
"也可以。主菜单和暂停菜单中也有此项。按两次 Escape 或 Start 退出。"

msgid "Starting and stopping the truck"
msgstr "启动和停下卡车"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "To shut it down, slow below five miles per hour."
msgstr "要熄火，先把车速降到每小时5英里以下。"

#. placeholders: {control_engine}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_engine} starts the engine."
msgstr "{control_engine}启动发动机。"

#. placeholders: {control_engine}
msgid ""
"{control_engine} starts the engine. To shut it down, slow below five miles "
"per hour."
msgstr "{control_engine}启动发动机。要熄火，先把车速降到每小时5英里以下。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Repeated hard braking uses air."
msgstr "反复急刹车会消耗气压。"

#. placeholders: {control_parking_brake}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Wait for air pressure to reach 100 psi, then use {control_parking_brake} to "
"release the parking brake."
msgstr "等气压达到100 psi，然后用{control_parking_brake}松开驻车制动。"

#. placeholders: {control_parking_brake}
msgid ""
"Wait for air pressure to reach 100 psi, then use {control_parking_brake} to "
"release the parking brake. Repeated hard braking uses air."
msgstr "等气压达到100 psi，然后用{control_parking_brake}松开驻车制动。反复急刹车会消耗气压。"

#. placeholders: {control_accelerate}, {control_brake}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Hold {control_accelerate} to accelerate and {control_brake} to brake."
msgstr "按住{control_accelerate}加速，按住{control_brake}刹车。"

#. placeholders: {control_accelerate}, {control_brake}, {control_emergency_brake}
msgid ""
"Hold {control_accelerate} to accelerate and {control_brake} to brake. Hold "
"{control_emergency_brake} for the hardest stop."
msgstr ""
"按住{control_accelerate}加速，按住{control_brake}刹车。按住{control_emergency_brake}可以最猛"
"烈地停车。"

#. placeholders: {control_emergency_brake}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Hold {control_emergency_brake} for the hardest stop."
msgstr "按住{control_emergency_brake}可以最猛烈地停车。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"A quick tap or a brake held through the stop keeps the truck stopped."
msgstr "快速轻按一下，或者停车时一直踩着刹车，卡车都会保持停住。"

#. placeholders: {control_brake}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"In automatic, stop fully, release {control_brake}, then press and hold it "
"again to reverse."
msgstr "自动挡时，完全停稳，松开{control_brake}，然后再按住它就能倒车。"

#. placeholders: {control_brake}
msgid ""
"In automatic, stop fully, release {control_brake}, then press and hold it "
"again to reverse. A quick tap or a brake held through the stop keeps the "
"truck stopped."
msgstr "自动挡时，完全停稳，松开{control_brake}，然后再按住它就能倒车。快速轻按一下，或者停车时一直踩着刹车，卡车都会保持停住。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Both direction-change styles use this gesture."
msgstr "两种换向方式都用这个操作。"

#. placeholders: {control_accelerate}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"While reversing, stop with {control_accelerate}, release it, then press and "
"hold again for forward."
msgstr "倒车时，用{control_accelerate}停下，松开，然后再按住它就能前进。"

#. placeholders: {control_accelerate}
msgid ""
"While reversing, stop with {control_accelerate}, release it, then press and "
"hold again for forward. Both direction-change styles use this gesture."
msgstr "倒车时，用{control_accelerate}停下，松开，然后再按住它就能前进。两种换向方式都用这个操作。"

msgid ""
"With Latching brake on, tap the brake, then press and hold again for half a "
"second. A click and announcement confirm the latch."
msgstr "打开锁定刹车后，轻按一下刹车，然后再按住半秒。一声咔嗒和一句播报确认已锁定。"

msgid ""
"Press the brake again or accelerate to release the latch. The throttle "
"never latches."
msgstr "再按一次刹车或踩油门即可解除锁定。油门永远不会锁定。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Applying it at speed causes a hard stop and tire damage."
msgstr "高速时拉驻车制动会导致急停并损坏轮胎。"

#. placeholders: {control_cruise}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Parked with it set, {control_cruise} holds high idle."
msgstr "拉着驻车制动停车时，{control_cruise}保持高怠速。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Set the parking brake when stopped."
msgstr "停车时拉上驻车制动。"

#. placeholders: {control_cruise}
msgid ""
"Set the parking brake when stopped. Applying it at speed causes a hard stop "
"and tire damage. Parked with it set, {control_cruise} holds high idle."
msgstr "停车时拉上驻车制动。高速时拉驻车制动会导致急停并损坏轮胎。拉着驻车制动停车时，{control_cruise}保持高怠速。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"For manual clutch, hold either Shift key on a keyboard or left bumper on a "
"controller."
msgstr "手动离合时，在键盘上按住任意一个Shift键，或在手柄上按住left bumper。"

#. placeholders: {control_shift_up}, {control_shift_down}, {control_neutral}, {control_reverse}
msgid ""
"For manual clutch, hold either Shift key on a keyboard or left bumper on a "
"controller. Then {control_shift_up} shifts up, {control_shift_down} down, "
"{control_neutral} selects neutral, and {control_reverse} selects reverse."
msgstr ""
"手动离合时，在键盘上按住任意一个Shift键，或在手柄上按住left "
"bumper。然后{control_shift_up}升挡，{control_shift_down}降挡，{control_neutral}挂空挡，{c"
"ontrol_reverse}挂倒挡。"

#. placeholders: {control_shift_up}, {control_shift_down}, {control_neutral}, {control_reverse}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Then {control_shift_up} shifts up, {control_shift_down} down, "
"{control_neutral} selects neutral, and {control_reverse} selects reverse."
msgstr ""
"然后{control_shift_up}升挡，{control_shift_down}降挡，{control_neutral}挂空挡，{control_"
"reverse}挂倒挡。"

#. placeholders: {control_horn}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_horn} sounds the horn while held."
msgstr "按住{control_horn}时鸣喇叭。"

#. placeholders: {control_transmission_mode}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_transmission_mode} switches automatic and manual shifting."
msgstr "{control_transmission_mode}在自动和手动换挡之间切换。"

#. placeholders: {control_transmission_mode}, {control_horn}
msgid ""
"{control_transmission_mode} switches automatic and manual shifting. "
"{control_horn} sounds the horn while held."
msgstr "{control_transmission_mode}在自动和手动换挡之间切换。按住{control_horn}时鸣喇叭。"

msgid "Speed control and hills"
msgstr "速度控制和坡道"

#. placeholders: {control_cruise}
msgid ""
"{control_cruise} starts automatic speed control: adaptive cruise on open "
"roads, speed keeper on supported low-speed roads."
msgstr "{control_cruise}启动自动速度控制：开阔道路上是自适应巡航，在支持的低速道路上是限速保持。"

msgid ""
"Cruise follows traffic. Its normal three second clear-weather gap increases "
"in poor weather. It does not steer."
msgstr "巡航会跟随车流。晴天时正常的3秒间隔，在恶劣天气中会加大。它不会转向。"

msgid ""
"Plus and Minus, including keypad keys, move the open-road target to the "
"next multiple of five. Hold Control to change it by one."
msgstr "加号和减号，包括小键盘上的，会把开阔道路目标速度调到下一个5的倍数。按住Control则每次改1。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Cruise prepares for sharp posted-limit drops and holds no more than five "
"over the posted limit."
msgstr "巡航会为限速的大幅下降提前做准备，并且最多只比限速高5。"

#. placeholders: {control_speed}
msgid ""
"Cruise prepares for sharp posted-limit drops and holds no more than five "
"over the posted limit. {control_speed} reads the active speed-control mode "
"and open-road target."
msgstr "巡航会为限速的大幅下降提前做准备，并且最多只比限速高5。{control_speed}读出当前的速度控制模式和开阔道路目标速度。"

#. placeholders: {control_speed}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{control_speed} reads the active speed-control mode and open-road target."
msgstr "{control_speed}读出当前的速度控制模式和开阔道路目标速度。"

msgid ""
"Speed keeper follows local limits, queues, and corners, then hands over to "
"cruise on open road. The target keys still change the remembered cruise "
"speed."
msgstr "限速保持会遵循当地限速、排队车流和转角，然后在开阔道路上交给巡航。目标速度键仍然会改变记住的巡航速度。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Pickup pauses the session through loading and resumes it after departure."
msgstr "取货时，这次控制在装货期间暂停，出发后恢复。"

#. placeholders: {control_cruise}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Press {control_cruise} again or touch the brakes to cancel."
msgstr "再按一次{control_cruise}或者踩一下刹车即可取消。"

#. placeholders: {control_cruise}, {control_cruise_resume}
msgid ""
"Press {control_cruise} again or touch the brakes to cancel. "
"{control_cruise_resume} resumes the previous target. Pickup pauses the "
"session through loading and resumes it after departure."
msgstr ""
"再按一次{control_cruise}或者踩一下刹车即可取消。{control_cruise_resume}恢复之前的目标速度。取货时，这次控制在装货"
"期间暂停，出发后恢复。"

#. placeholders: {control_cruise_resume}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_cruise_resume} resumes the previous target."
msgstr "{control_cruise_resume}恢复之前的目标速度。"

msgid ""
"Before a descent, reduce speed and choose a lower gear. Use the engine "
"brake for steady control and short brake applications with cooling time "
"between them."
msgstr "下坡之前，先减速并换到低挡。用发动机制动稳定控制车速，刹车要短促，中间留出冷却时间。"

#. placeholders: {control_jake_stage_1}, {control_jake_stage_2}, {control_jake_stage_3}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"While enabled, {control_jake_stage_1}, {control_jake_stage_2}, and "
"{control_jake_stage_3} choose its stage."
msgstr ""
"开启后，{control_jake_stage_1}、{control_jake_stage_2}和{control_jake_stage_3}选择它的"
"档位。"

#. placeholders: {control_auto_jake}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_auto_jake} selects automatic or manual stage management."
msgstr "{control_auto_jake}选择自动或手动管理档位。"

#. placeholders: {control_engine_brake}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_engine_brake} enables the engine brake."
msgstr "{control_engine_brake}开启发动机制动。"

#. placeholders: {control_engine_brake}, {control_jake_stage_1}, {control_jake_stage_2}, {control_jake_stage_3}, {control_auto_jake}
msgid ""
"{control_engine_brake} enables the engine brake. While enabled, "
"{control_jake_stage_1}, {control_jake_stage_2}, and {control_jake_stage_3} "
"choose its stage. {control_auto_jake} selects automatic or manual stage "
"management."
msgstr ""
"{control_engine_brake}开启发动机制动。开启后，{control_jake_stage_1}、{control_jake_stage"
"_2}和{control_jake_stage_3}选择它的档位。{control_auto_jake}选择自动或手动管理档位。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Hot brakes lose stopping power."
msgstr "刹车过热会失去制动力。"

#. placeholders: {control_safe_speed}
msgid ""
"Hot brakes lose stopping power. {control_safe_speed} gives a safe speed for "
"the load, grade, weather, and bend. Strong engine braking can break "
"traction on ice."
msgstr ""
"刹车过热会失去制动力。{control_safe_speed}给出适合当前货物、坡道、天气和弯道的安全车速。在冰面上，强力的发动机制动可能让车轮打滑。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Strong engine braking can break traction on ice."
msgstr "在冰面上，强力的发动机制动可能让车轮打滑。"

#. placeholders: {control_safe_speed}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{control_safe_speed} gives a safe speed for the load, grade, weather, and "
"bend."
msgstr "{control_safe_speed}给出适合当前货物、坡道、天气和弯道的安全车速。"

msgid ""
"Noise-restricted towns warn before fining engine braking. Downhill grades "
"and emergencies have exceptions."
msgstr "有噪音限制的城镇会在对发动机制动罚款前先发出警告。下坡和紧急情况有例外。"

msgid "Driving information keys"
msgstr "驾驶信息键"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"It adds RPM with a manual transmission, air or brakes when they need "
"attention, and the distance to an exit you signaled for."
msgstr "它增加了手动变速箱的转速，需要注意时的空气或刹车，以及到你发出信号的出口的距离。"

#. placeholders: {control_speed}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_speed} speaks your speed, gear, and speed-control mode."
msgstr "{control_speed} 表示你的速度、档位和速度控制模式。"

#. placeholders: {control_speed}
msgid ""
"{control_speed} speaks your speed, gear, and speed-control mode. It adds "
"RPM with a manual transmission, air or brakes when they need attention, and "
"the distance to an exit you signaled for."
msgstr ""
"{control_speed} 表示你的速度、档位和速度控制模式。它增加了手动变速箱的转速，需要注意时的空气或刹车，以及到你发出信号的出口的距离。"

#. placeholders: {control_safe_speed}, {control_grade}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{control_safe_speed} gives the current safe speed; {control_grade} reads "
"the current and next relevant grade."
msgstr "{control_safe_speed}给出当前的安全车速；{control_grade}读出当前和下一个相关的坡道。"

#. placeholders: {control_speed_limit}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{control_speed_limit} speaks the posted speed limit, zone, and how far over "
"you are."
msgstr "{control_speed_limit}说出标示的限速、区域，以及你超速多少。"

#. placeholders: {control_speed_limit}, {control_safe_speed}, {control_grade}
msgid ""
"{control_speed_limit} speaks the posted speed limit, zone, and how far over "
"you are. {control_safe_speed} gives the current safe speed; {control_grade} "
"reads the current and next relevant grade."
msgstr ""
"{control_speed_limit}说出标示的限速、区域，以及你超速多少。{control_safe_speed}给出当前的安全车速；{contr"
"ol_grade}读出当前和下一个相关的坡道。"

#. placeholders: {control_clock}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_clock} reads the clock, deadline, and nearest hours limit."
msgstr "{control_clock}读出时钟、截止时间和最近的工时限制。"

#. placeholders: {control_fuel}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_fuel} reads fuel and range."
msgstr "{control_fuel}读出燃油和续航里程。"

#. placeholders: {control_fuel}, {control_clock}
msgid ""
"{control_fuel} reads fuel and range. {control_clock} reads the clock, "
"deadline, and nearest hours limit."
msgstr "{control_fuel}读出燃油和续航里程。{control_clock}读出时钟、截止时间和最近的工时限制。"

#. placeholders: {control_hos_break}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_hos_break} reads when the break is due."
msgstr "{control_hos_break}读出中途休息什么时候到期。"

#. placeholders: {control_hos_drive}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{control_hos_drive} reads what ends the shift and reachable legal rest."
msgstr "{control_hos_drive}读出什么会结束这一班，以及能到达的合法休息地点。"

#. placeholders: {control_hos_wheel}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_hos_wheel} speaks time at the wheel and on duty."
msgstr "{control_hos_wheel}说出已驾驶时间和当班时间。"

#. placeholders: {control_hos_wheel}, {control_hos_break}, {control_hos_drive}
msgid ""
"{control_hos_wheel} speaks time at the wheel and on duty. "
"{control_hos_break} reads when the break is due. {control_hos_drive} reads "
"what ends the shift and reachable legal rest."
msgstr ""
"{control_hos_wheel}说出已驾驶时间和当班时间。{control_hos_break}读出中途休息什么时候到期。{control_hos"
"_drive}读出什么会结束这一班，以及能到达的合法休息地点。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "A planned stop changes the distance to that stop."
msgstr "有计划停靠点时，距离会改为到那个停靠点的距离。"

#. placeholders: {control_route}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{control_route} speaks how far along you are, distance remaining, and your "
"location."
msgstr "{control_route}说出你走了多远、剩余距离和你的位置。"

#. placeholders: {control_route}
msgid ""
"{control_route} speaks how far along you are, distance remaining, and your "
"location. A planned stop changes the distance to that stop."
msgstr "{control_route}说出你走了多远、剩余距离和你的位置。有计划停靠点时，距离会改为到那个停靠点的距离。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Keypad equivalents work too."
msgstr "小键盘上对应的键也可以用。"

#. placeholders: {control_place_state}, {control_place_road}, {control_place_town}, {control_place_direction}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{control_place_state} reads the state, {control_place_road} the road, "
"{control_place_town} the town or nearest town, and "
"{control_place_direction} the direction."
msgstr ""
"{control_place_state}读出州，{control_place_road}读出道路，{control_place_town}读出城镇或最"
"近的城镇，{control_place_direction}读出方向。"

#. placeholders: {control_place_state}, {control_place_road}, {control_place_town}, {control_place_direction}
msgid ""
"{control_place_state} reads the state, {control_place_road} the road, "
"{control_place_town} the town or nearest town, and "
"{control_place_direction} the direction. Keypad equivalents work too."
msgstr ""
"{control_place_state}读出州，{control_place_road}读出道路，{control_place_town}读出城镇或最"
"近的城镇，{control_place_direction}读出方向。小键盘上对应的键也可以用。"

#. placeholders: {control_lane}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{control_lane} reads lane position and whether the lane beside you is open."
msgstr "{control_lane}读出车道位置，以及旁边的车道是否畅通。"

#. placeholders: {control_weather}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_weather} reads weather."
msgstr "{control_weather}读出天气。"

#. placeholders: {control_weather}, {control_lane}
msgid ""
"{control_weather} reads weather. {control_lane} reads lane position and "
"whether the lane beside you is open."
msgstr "{control_weather}读出天气。{control_lane}读出车道位置，以及旁边的车道是否畅通。"

#. placeholders: {control_rest}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{control_rest} plans rest while moving or opens a nearby stop when fully "
"stopped."
msgstr "{control_rest}在行驶中规划休息，完全停下时则打开附近的停靠点。"

#. placeholders: {control_take_exit}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{control_take_exit} signals for an announced exit or cancels the signal."
msgstr "{control_take_exit}为已播报的出口打转向灯，或取消转向灯。"

#. placeholders: {control_take_exit}, {control_rest}
msgid ""
"{control_take_exit} signals for an announced exit or cancels the signal. "
"{control_rest} plans rest while moving or opens a nearby stop when fully "
"stopped."
msgstr ""
"{control_take_exit}为已播报的出口打转向灯，或取消转向灯。{control_rest}在行驶中规划休息，完全停下时则打开附近的停靠点。"

#. placeholders: {control_upcoming}
msgid ""
"{control_upcoming} speaks the road ahead that no other key answers: your "
"signaled exit, ramp control, next lower limit, stop, and bend requiring "
"slowing."
msgstr ""
"{control_upcoming}说出其他键都不回答的前方道路信息：你打了转向灯的出口、匝道控制、下一个更低的限速、停靠点，以及需要减速的弯道。"

#. placeholders: {control_cb}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_cb} repeats the last CB chatter with its current distance."
msgstr "{control_cb}重复最近一条CB闲聊，并说出它现在的距离。"

#. placeholders: {control_last_announcement}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_last_announcement} repeats the last driving announcement."
msgstr "{control_last_announcement}重复最近一条驾驶播报。"

#. placeholders: {control_last_announcement}, {control_cb}
msgid ""
"{control_last_announcement} repeats the last driving announcement. "
"{control_cb} repeats the last CB chatter with its current distance."
msgstr ""
"{control_last_announcement}重复最近一条驾驶播报。{control_cb}重复最近一条CB闲聊，并说出它现在的距离。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Use the reports for trip details or open an app for a specific task."
msgstr "用报告查看行程详情，或打开一个应用来做具体的事。"

#. placeholders: {control_status}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{control_status} opens Route, Driver, Map, and Radio reports, plus Driver "
"apps."
msgstr "{control_status}打开路线、司机、地图和电台报告，以及司机应用。"

#. placeholders: {control_status}
msgid ""
"{control_status} opens Route, Driver, Map, and Radio reports, plus Driver "
"apps. Use the reports for trip details or open an app for a specific task."
msgstr "{control_status}打开路线、司机、地图和电台报告，以及司机应用。用报告查看行程详情，或打开一个应用来做具体的事。"

msgid ""
"Left or Right Control stops the driving event voice. Escape pauses. F2 "
"lists driving commands by name; Enter runs the selected command."
msgstr "左右任意一个Control键停止驾驶事件语音。Escape暂停。F2按名称列出驾驶命令；Enter执行选中的命令。"

msgid ""
"Change eligible shortcuts under Settings, Gameplay, Controls, then Keyboard "
"shortcuts or Controller buttons. These pages follow your assignments."
msgstr "可以在设置、游戏玩法、操作里，再进入快捷键或手柄按键，更改可调整的快捷键。这些页面会跟随你的分配。"

msgid "Steering and curves"
msgstr "转向和弯道"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Full lane keeping centers the truck, follows bends, and takes route exits "
"including the destination."
msgstr "车道保持为完全时，卡车会居中行驶、跟着弯道走，并驶出路线上的出口，包括目的地出口。"

#. placeholders: {control_steer_left}, {control_steer_right}
msgid ""
"Full lane keeping centers the truck, follows bends, and takes route exits "
"including the destination. Tap {control_steer_left} or "
"{control_steer_right} to change lanes."
msgstr ""
"车道保持为完全时，卡车会居中行驶、跟着弯道走，并驶出路线上的出口，包括目的地出口。轻按{control_steer_left}或{control_ste"
"er_right}即可变道。"

#. placeholders: {control_steer_left}, {control_steer_right}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Tap {control_steer_left} or {control_steer_right} to change lanes."
msgstr "轻按{control_steer_left}或{control_steer_right}即可变道。"

msgid ""
"Partial follows bends with gentle drift. Off leaves steering to you unless "
"curve assistance is enabled. Hold a steering control across the lane line "
"to change lanes."
msgstr "部分会跟着弯道走，偏移很轻。关闭时转向全由你负责，除非开启了弯道辅助。按住一个转向控制键越过车道线即可变道。"

msgid ""
"With the default steering guide, steer toward the engine's lean. Road noise "
"tells you position: sound to the right means the truck sits right of center."
msgstr "使用默认的转向引导时，朝发动机声音偏向的一侧转。道路噪音告诉你位置：声音在右边，说明卡车偏在中心右侧。"

msgid ""
"With lane keeping off and curve assistance off, hold toward a called bend "
"to follow the road. Releasing the control squares the truck with the road."
msgstr "车道保持和弯道辅助都关闭时，朝播报的弯道方向按住转向键就能沿着道路走。松开控制键，卡车会和道路摆正。"

#. placeholders: {control_straighten}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Hold {control_straighten} to straighten while another control stays held."
msgstr "按住{control_straighten}可以在按住另一个控制键的同时回正方向。"

#. placeholders: {control_straighten}
msgid ""
"Hold {control_straighten} to straighten while another control stays held. "
"Your position within the lane remains yours to correct."
msgstr "按住{control_straighten}可以在按住另一个控制键的同时回正方向。你在车道中的位置仍然要你自己修正。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Your position within the lane remains yours to correct."
msgstr "你在车道中的位置仍然要你自己修正。"

msgid ""
"The curve call gives direction, distance, and advisory speed. Brake to that "
"speed before the bend. A tone marks the bend's side."
msgstr "弯道播报会给出方向、距离和建议车速。进弯前刹车到那个速度。一个提示音标出弯道在哪一侧。"

msgid ""
"Rumble-strip and gravel sounds come from the edge you reached. Correct "
"gently. Crossing an undivided centerline puts you in opposing traffic."
msgstr "振动带和碎石声来自你压到的那一侧路边。轻轻修正。越过没有分隔的中线会进入对向车流。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Steering guide can reverse the convention; Lane guide sound can use a "
"separate soft tone."
msgstr "“转向引导”可以反转这个约定；“车道引导声音”可以改用单独的轻柔提示音。"

#. placeholders: {control_lane_locator}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{control_lane_locator} toggles a continuous lane-position tock on partial "
"or off."
msgstr "在部分或关闭时，{control_lane_locator}开关持续的车道位置嗒嗒声。"

#. placeholders: {control_lane_locator}
msgid ""
"{control_lane_locator} toggles a continuous lane-position tock on partial "
"or off. Steering guide can reverse the convention; Lane guide sound can use "
"a separate soft tone."
msgstr ""
"在部分或关闭时，{control_lane_locator}开关持续的车道位置嗒嗒声。“转向引导”可以反转这个约定；“车道引导声音”可以改用单独的轻柔提"
"示音。"

msgid ""
"Curve assistance slows and steers through mapped bends. Your brake releases "
"its slowing for that bend, while steering assistance remains."
msgstr "弯道辅助会在地图上标注的弯道里减速并转向。你一踩刹车，它就放弃这个弯道的减速，但转向辅助仍然保留。"

msgid "Exits, ramps, and arrival"
msgstr "出口、匝道和到达"

#. placeholders: {control_rest}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Press {control_rest} again to cancel the plan."
msgstr ""

#. placeholders: {control_rest}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"While rolling, {control_rest} asks what the stop is for: fuel, a break, "
"sleep, fuel and sleep, or food."
msgstr ""

#. placeholders: {control_rest}
msgid ""
"While rolling, {control_rest} asks what the stop is for: fuel, a break, "
"sleep, fuel and sleep, or food. With hours-planning hints on, a break or "
"sleep plan takes the recommended stop. Press {control_rest} again to cancel "
"the plan."
msgstr ""

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"With hours-planning hints on, a break or sleep plan takes the recommended "
"stop."
msgstr ""

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Planning a stop does not signal for it."
msgstr "规划停靠点并不会为它打转向灯。"

#. placeholders: {control_take_exit}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{control_take_exit} separately signals for the announced exit or cancels "
"the signal."
msgstr "{control_take_exit}另外负责为已播报的出口打转向灯或取消转向灯。"

#. placeholders: {control_take_exit}
msgid ""
"{control_take_exit} separately signals for the announced exit or cancels "
"the signal. Planning a stop does not signal for it."
msgstr "{control_take_exit}另外负责为已播报的出口打转向灯或取消转向灯。规划停靠点并不会为它打转向灯。"

msgid ""
"Unless lane keeping is on full, move to the right lane, then steer right "
"into the exit lane when it opens."
msgstr "除非车道保持为完全，否则先移到右侧车道，等出口车道出现时再向右转进去。"

msgid ""
"Keep road speed until the exit lane. Brake to the announced exit speed "
"before its curve. Full lane keeping makes the lane moves for you."
msgstr "一直保持道路车速到出口车道。在匝道弯之前刹车到播报的出口速度。车道保持为完全时会替你变道。"

msgid ""
"Most ramps end at a light or stop sign. Stop at red; stop safely for yellow "
"if possible. At a stop sign, wait for a clear gap after stopping."
msgstr "大多数匝道的尽头是红绿灯或停车标志。红灯要停；黄灯时如果能安全停下就停。在停车标志处，停稳后等出现足够的空当再走。"

msgid ""
"Every light change is spoken. The sensor tick speeds up near the stop bar. "
"Cross traffic can hit a truck that runs through."
msgstr "每次信号灯变化都会播报。靠近停止线时，传感器的滴答声会变快。闯过去的卡车可能会被横向车流撞上。"

msgid ""
"When clear, pull ahead as instructed. Facility stopping assistance can take "
"the pedals to the gate; your brake releases it."
msgstr "安全时按指示往前开。厂区停车辅助可以接管踏板一直开到大门；你一踩刹车它就解除。"

msgid ""
"Follow the local street and yard guidance, stop at the gate, then confirm "
"arrival. At the receiver choose Dock and deliver."
msgstr "按照当地街道和场院的引导行驶，在大门停下，然后确认到达。到了收货方，选择“靠装卸口交付”。"

msgid ""
"Miss the destination exit and follow the next safe turnaround. Ordinary "
"exits without a current action stay quiet."
msgstr "错过目的地出口时，就按下一个安全掉头走。当前不需要操作的普通出口不会播报。"

#. placeholders: {control_rest}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Fully stopped at a route stop, {control_rest} opens its services."
msgstr "在路线停靠点完全停下时，{control_rest}打开它的服务。"

#. placeholders: {control_rest}
msgid ""
"Fully stopped at a route stop, {control_rest} opens its services. Fully "
"stopped elsewhere, {control_rest} opens the emergency shoulder-sleep "
"warning; nearby route points always take priority."
msgstr ""
"在路线停靠点完全停下时，{control_rest}打开它的服务。在其他地方完全停下时，{control_rest}打开紧急路肩睡觉的警告；附近的路线地"
"点总是优先。"

#. placeholders: {control_rest}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Fully stopped elsewhere, {control_rest} opens the emergency shoulder-sleep "
"warning; nearby route points always take priority."
msgstr "在其他地方完全停下时，{control_rest}打开紧急路肩睡觉的警告；附近的路线地点总是优先。"

msgid "Traffic, weather, and enforcement"
msgstr "车流、天气和执法"

msgid ""
"GPS announces state lines, towns, route changes, traffic, work zones, and "
"useful stops. Grades and terrain come from the route; weather and traffic "
"vary by place and time."
msgstr "GPS会播报州界、城镇、路线变化、车流、施工区和有用的停靠点。坡道和地形来自路线；天气和车流随地点和时间变化。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Check before changing lanes or returning after a pass."
msgstr "变道前或超车后回到原车道前，先检查一下。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Nearby vehicles merge, slow, pass, and queue."
msgstr "附近的车辆会汇入、减速、超车和排队。"

#. placeholders: {control_lane}
msgid ""
"Nearby vehicles merge, slow, pass, and queue. {control_lane} tells you "
"which neighboring lanes are available. Check before changing lanes or "
"returning after a pass."
msgstr "附近的车辆会汇入、减速、超车和排队。{control_lane}告诉你相邻的哪些车道可用。变道前或超车后回到原车道前，先检查一下。"

#. placeholders: {control_lane}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_lane} tells you which neighboring lanes are available."
msgstr "{control_lane}告诉你相邻的哪些车道可用。"

msgid ""
"A passing vehicle grows louder alongside you, then fades ahead. Listen for "
"which side it is on, but use the lane check before moving over."
msgstr "超车的车辆在你旁边时声音变大，然后在前方渐渐变小。听它在哪一侧，但并道前还是要先检查车道。"

msgid ""
"Mainline traffic stays to your left on an on-ramp. The distant freeway "
"sound follows traffic activity, so busy and quiet stretches sound different."
msgstr "在入口匝道上，主线车流在你的左边。远处高速公路的声音随车流活动变化，所以繁忙路段和安静路段听起来不一样。"

msgid ""
"Brake now means slow promptly. Change lanes or brake names an available "
"lane. A fixed object needs a near-stop if you cannot change lanes."
msgstr "“刹车”表示马上减速。“变道或刹车”会说出可用的车道。如果无法变道，遇到固定障碍物就要几乎停下。"

msgid ""
"No lane open means brake. Full lane keeping can pass slow vehicles, but "
"leaves debris avoidance to you and avoids starting a pass near an exit."
msgstr "没有畅通的车道就意味着要刹车。车道保持为完全时可以超过慢车，但躲避路上的杂物要靠你自己，而且它不会在出口附近开始超车。"

msgid ""
"Leave a coned lane when warned. Driving through barrels causes damage, a "
"citation, and a serious violation."
msgstr "收到警告时，离开放了锥桶的车道。从路障桶中间穿过会造成损坏、吃罚单，还会记一次严重违规。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Snow and ice need gentler braking and steering."
msgstr "雪天和冰面上，刹车和转向都要更轻柔。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Weather changes grip, visibility, safe speed, following distance, and fuel "
"use."
msgstr "天气会改变抓地力、能见度、安全车速、跟车距离和油耗。"

#. placeholders: {control_weather}
msgid ""
"Weather changes grip, visibility, safe speed, following distance, and fuel "
"use. {control_weather} reports conditions. Snow and ice need gentler "
"braking and steering."
msgstr ""
"天气会改变抓地力、能见度、安全车速、跟车距离和油耗。{control_weather}报告路况天气。雪天和冰面上，刹车和转向都要更轻柔。"

#. placeholders: {control_weather}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_weather} reports conditions."
msgstr "{control_weather}报告路况天气。"

msgid ""
"The calendar starts in spring and advances with driving and rest. Live "
"weather can follow the real date or an independent career calendar."
msgstr "日历从春天开始，随着驾驶和休息推进。实时天气可以跟随真实日期，也可以跟随独立的职业生涯日历。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Ignoring the lights escalates to a forced stop or pursuit."
msgstr "不理会警灯会升级为强制拦停或追捕。"

#. placeholders: {control_take_exit}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"When a trooper signals you, use {control_take_exit} and brake to a stop for "
"a license and logbook check."
msgstr "州警向你示意时，用{control_take_exit}并刹车停下，接受驾照和驾驶日志检查。"

#. placeholders: {control_take_exit}
msgid ""
"When a trooper signals you, use {control_take_exit} and brake to a stop for "
"a license and logbook check. Ignoring the lights escalates to a forced stop "
"or pursuit."
msgstr "州警向你示意时，用{control_take_exit}并刹车停下，接受驾照和驾驶日志检查。不理会警灯会升级为强制拦停或追捕。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "CB chatter reports what other drivers saw, with uncertainty."
msgstr "CB闲聊会报告其他司机看到的情况，但不一定准确。"

#. placeholders: {control_cb}
msgid ""
"CB chatter reports what other drivers saw, with uncertainty. It can be "
"stale and never claims the road is clear. {control_cb} repeats it with "
"updated distance."
msgstr "CB闲聊会报告其他司机看到的情况，但不一定准确。它可能已经过时，而且从不保证道路畅通。{control_cb}会重复它，并更新距离。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "It can be stale and never claims the road is clear."
msgstr "它可能已经过时，而且从不保证道路畅通。"

#. placeholders: {control_cb}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_cb} repeats it with updated distance."
msgstr "{control_cb}会重复它，并更新距离。"

msgid ""
"Citations cost money and affect your record. Serious violations can suspend "
"your CDL and remove driving work; fleeing is a major offense."
msgstr "罚单要花钱，还会影响你的记录。严重违规可能导致你的CDL被暂扣，失去驾驶工作；逃跑属于重大违法。"

msgid ""
"The dash overspeed chime is a free warning. Tickets already paid on the "
"road are not charged again at settlement."
msgstr "仪表盘的超速提示音是免费的警告。在路上已经交过的罚款，结算时不会再扣一次。"

#. placeholders: {control_take_exit}, {control_rest}
msgid ""
"At an open scale, slow into its lane, signal with {control_take_exit}, "
"stop, then use {control_rest} for inspection check-in."
msgstr ""
"遇到开放的称重站，减速驶入它的车道，用{control_take_exit}打转向灯，停下，然后用{control_rest}登记接受检查。"

msgid "Hours, fatigue, and rest stops"
msgstr "工时、疲劳和休息停靠点"

msgid ""
"The hours clock permits eleven driving hours after ten hours off, inside a "
"fourteen-hour duty window. A thirty-minute break is due after eight "
"cumulative driving hours."
msgstr "工时时钟规定，休息10小时后可以驾驶11小时，并且要在14小时的当班时段内。累计驾驶8小时后，需要一次30分钟的中途休息。"

msgid ""
"Any thirty consecutive non-driving minutes satisfy that break, including "
"loading or inspection. They do not necessarily reset the duty window."
msgstr "任何连续30分钟不驾驶的时间都算这次中途休息，包括装货或检查。但它们不一定会重置当班时段。"

msgid ""
"Both hours modes use these limits. Relaxed changes enforcement pressure. "
"One warning comes before each limit: one hour left in the Relaxed driving "
"mode, two hours in Standard, and two hours, one hour and thirty minutes in "
"Real time. None comes for a limit the trip ends inside."
msgstr ""

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Check again as traffic or weather changes."
msgstr "车流或天气变化时再查一次。"

#. placeholders: {control_hos_wheel}, {control_hos_break}, {control_hos_drive}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{control_hos_wheel} reads time used, {control_hos_break} the break, and "
"{control_hos_drive} the shift limits and reachable rest."
msgstr ""
"{control_hos_wheel}读出已用时间，{control_hos_break}读出中途休息，{control_hos_drive}读出这一班"
"的限制和能到达的休息地点。"

#. placeholders: {control_hos_wheel}, {control_hos_break}, {control_hos_drive}
msgid ""
"{control_hos_wheel} reads time used, {control_hos_break} the break, and "
"{control_hos_drive} the shift limits and reachable rest. Check again as "
"traffic or weather changes."
msgstr ""
"{control_hos_wheel}读出已用时间，{control_hos_break}读出中途休息，{control_hos_drive}读出这一班"
"的限制和能到达的休息地点。车流或天气变化时再查一次。"

msgid ""
"Ten-hour sleep is the simplest reset. Supported sleeper parking offers two, "
"three, seven, or eight hours for an eight-plus-two or seven-plus-three "
"split."
msgstr "睡满10小时是最简单的重置。支持卧铺的停车位可以选择2、3、7或8小时，用来做8加2或7加3的分段休息。"

msgid ""
"The long split pauses the duty window. The short half counts until the pair "
"completes. A nap that leaves the window running tells you when it closes."
msgstr "长的那一段会暂停当班时段。短的那一半在两段凑齐之前一直计入。如果小睡时当班时段还在走，会告诉你它什么时候结束。"

msgid ""
"Fatigue rises faster at night and reduces reaction time. Respond to nod-off "
"warnings by steering or braking. Repeated misses can force you off the road."
msgstr "夜里疲劳上升得更快，并会降低反应速度。收到打瞌睡警告时，要转向或刹车回应。反复错过可能会让你被迫离开道路。"

msgid ""
"Meals and coffee help temporarily. A half-hour meal counts as a break. "
"Proper sleep clears fatigue; a legal reset with poor rest can leave you "
"tired."
msgstr "吃饭和咖啡只能暂时帮忙。半小时的用餐算作一次中途休息。好好睡一觉才能消除疲劳；合法重置但休息不好，你可能仍然疲惫。"

msgid ""
"A stop offers only its listed services. A full parking lot can still sell "
"diesel. A motel may offer full rest at your expense."
msgstr "停靠点只提供列出的服务。停车场满了也可能还在卖柴油。汽车旅馆可能提供完整休息，但要你自己付钱。"

msgid ""
"Sleep 10 hours in the lot is poor rest. Sleeper parking gives fully-rested "
"ten-hour sleep."
msgstr "“在停车场睡10小时”休息效果不好。卧铺停车位能让你睡满10小时并完全恢复。"

#. placeholders: {control_rest}
msgid ""
"Away from route points and fully stopped, {control_rest} or the pause menu "
"offers emergency shoulder sleep: ten hours pass, with poor rest and "
"possible parking ticket or minor damage."
msgstr ""
"远离路线地点并完全停下时，{control_rest}或暂停菜单提供紧急路肩睡觉：过去10小时，休息效果差，还可能吃停车罚单或受到轻微损坏。"

msgid ""
"The deadline keeps running during all rest. Logbook at the terminal and the "
"ELD app let you review duty and limits."
msgstr "截止时间在所有休息期间都会继续走。场站的“驾驶日志”和ELD应用可以让你查看当班情况和各项限制。"

msgid "Career, equipment, and money"
msgstr "职业生涯、设备和钱"

msgid ""
"New company hires get an assigned load. Load choice opens at level eight. "
"Declining costs trust; low trust can remove load choice again."
msgstr "新入职的公司司机会被分配货物。8级时开放自选货物。拒绝会降低信任度；信任度低时可能再次失去自选货物。"

msgid ""
"Jobs name cargo, weight, pay, deadline, facilities, and equipment "
"requirements. F1 reads the details. Fuel adds weight; check before filling "
"a marginal load."
msgstr "任务会说明货物、重量、报酬、截止时间、厂区和设备要求。F1读出详情。燃油也会增加重量；如果货物重量接近上限，加满油之前先检查一下。"

msgid ""
"Walk around a dropped trailer before leaving. A defect can be refused at "
"the yard or found later at inspection."
msgstr "离开前，绕甩挂的挂车走一圈检查。缺陷可能在场院被拒收，或者稍后在检查时被发现。"

msgid ""
"Company drivers receive wages and bonuses. Owners receive higher gross with "
"fuel, repair, reserves, trailer charges, and fees to pay."
msgstr "公司司机拿工资和奖金。车主司机的毛收入更高，但要支付燃油、维修、准备金、挂车费用和各种费用。"

msgid ""
"Settlement separates gross pay, carrier-paid or reimbursed charges, driver "
"costs, and net driver pay. On-time and undamaged freight pays better."
msgstr "结算会分开列出毛收入、承运商支付或报销的费用、司机成本，以及司机净收入。按时且没有损坏的货物收入更高。"

msgid ""
"Unpaid charges become a balance owed. Later settlements use one quarter for "
"debt and advances together, leaving three quarters as take-home."
msgstr "未付的费用会变成未结欠款。之后的结算会拿出四分之一同时偿还债务和预支款，剩下四分之三归你。"

msgid ""
"Debt warnings name the ceiling and consequence. At the ceiling, a company "
"driver changes carrier or an owner loses tractors and returns to company "
"driving."
msgstr "债务警告会说明上限和后果。达到上限时，公司司机会更换承运商，车主司机则会失去牵引车，回去当公司司机。"

msgid ""
"You keep career level, experience, endorsements, and record. Career stats "
"reads debt and trust; Business status explains ownership requirements."
msgstr "你会保留职业等级、经验、驾照签注和记录。“职业统计”读出债务和信任度；“经营状况”说明拥有车辆的要求。"

msgid ""
"The garage refuels, repairs, replaces tires, and services brakes and "
"engines. Company routine costs use the carrier account; owners can buy "
"partial service when cash is short."
msgstr "修理厂可以加油、维修、换轮胎，以及保养刹车和发动机。公司的日常费用走承运商账户；车主司机现金不够时可以只买部分服务。"

msgid ""
"At eighty percent component wear, arrange service. At one hundred, that "
"component puts the truck out of service. Damage has separate reduced-power, "
"limp-mode, and out-of-service bands."
msgstr "部件磨损到百分之80时，安排保养。到百分之100时，这个部件会让卡车停驶。损坏另有动力受限、跛行模式和停驶几个阶段。"

msgid ""
"Owners buy tractors, upgrades, and trailer programs. Each truck keeps its "
"condition; upgrades apply across the fleet."
msgstr "车主司机可以购买牵引车、升级和挂车项目。每辆卡车保留各自的车况；升级适用于整个车队。"

msgid ""
"Licenses and training opens refrigerated, heavy-haul, high-value, liquid "
"bulk, doubles, hazardous, port, and long-combination freight as "
"requirements clear."
msgstr "随着条件满足，“驾照与培训”会开放冷藏、重型、高价值、液体散装、双挂、危险品、港口和长组合货物。"

msgid "The garage and freight markets"
msgstr "修理厂和货运市场"

msgid ""
"Each metro represents a wider freight area with many shippers: rail and "
"intermodal ramps, parcel hubs, farms, grain elevators, chemical terminals, "
"and other facilities."
msgstr "每个大都市代表一个更大的货运区域，有许多发货方：铁路和多式联运装卸坡道、包裹中心、农场、粮仓、化工场站和其他设施。"

msgid ""
"Facilities determine local cargo. Dispatch routes include stops for fuel "
"and legal rest; F1 reads the load's requirements before you accept it."
msgstr "设施决定当地的货物。调度的路线包含加油和合法休息的停靠点；接受之前，F1会读出这批货物的要求。"

msgid ""
"Owners can add reefer, flatbed, and bulk programs. Company trailers cover "
"the equipment requirements of approved loads."
msgstr "车主司机可以加入冷藏、平板和散装挂车项目。公司的挂车满足已批准货物的设备要求。"

msgid ""
"An engine tune adds pulling power. An aerodynamic kit reduces highway fuel "
"burn. A long-range tank adds fifty gallons; reinforced brakes resist fade "
"longer."
msgstr "发动机调校增加牵引力。空气动力套件降低公路油耗。长续航油箱多装50加仑；加强刹车能更久地抵抗热衰退。"

msgid ""
"Company equipment improves with seniority. Low trust can hold it back until "
"your record and finances recover."
msgstr "公司设备会随资历提升。信任度低时可能会被压着，直到你的记录和财务恢复。"

msgid ""
"Terminal garages offer repair, tires, brakes, engine service, and washing. "
"Road stops offer only the services listed for that location."
msgstr "场站的修理厂提供维修、轮胎、刹车、发动机保养和洗车。路上的停靠点只提供那个地点列出的服务。"

msgid ""
"Damage above fifty percent reduces power; above seventy-five brings limp "
"mode and a forty-five mile per hour cap. Above ninety puts the truck out of "
"service."
msgstr "损坏超过百分之50时动力下降；超过百分之75进入跛行模式，车速限制在每小时45英里。超过百分之90卡车就会停驶。"

msgid ""
"A roadside mechanic can help during a trip. Stop safely and use the pause "
"menu or Call dispatch for help."
msgstr "行程中可以请路边技师帮忙。安全停车，然后用暂停菜单或“呼叫调度”求助。"

msgid "Winter equipment"
msgstr "冬季装备"

msgid ""
"Winter tires improve snow and ice grip. Chains are carried until you "
"install them while stopped through the pause menu."
msgstr "冬季轮胎能提高雪地和冰面上的抓地力。防滑链会一直带在车上，直到你停车后通过暂停菜单装上。"

msgid ""
"Chain laws require chains on a truck at every level. Winter tires don't "
"count for a semi. The exceptions are level one in Colorado and Oregon, "
"which chain only single-drive-axle trucks, and in Wyoming, which accepts "
"snow tires. Signs announce the requirement before the chain-up area."
msgstr ""
"各级防滑链规定都可能要求卡车安装防滑链，半挂卡车不能仅凭冬季轮胎满足要求。例外情况是Colorado和Oregon的1级规定，仅要求单驱动轴卡车安装；W"
"yoming则接受雪地轮胎。安装区前会有标志说明要求。"

msgid ""
"Chain work uses on-duty time and adds fatigue, especially at night. Keep "
"under chain speed, 30 miles per hour or 48 kilometers per hour, and remove "
"chains on bare pavement before they break."
msgstr ""
"安装和维护防滑链会占用当班时间并增加疲劳，夜间尤其如此。安装后车速不得超过每小时30英里或每小时48公里；驶上无冰雪路面后应及时拆除，以免断裂。"

msgid ""
"Worn tires and strong engine braking make slippery roads harder to control. "
"Stop for rest or safer conditions when necessary."
msgstr "磨损的轮胎和强力的发动机制动会让湿滑路面更难控制。必要时停下来休息，或等路况更安全再走。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Escape returns."
msgstr "Escape返回。"

#. placeholders: {control_status}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Open driving status with {control_status}, then choose Driver apps."
msgstr "用{control_status}打开驾驶状态，然后选择“司机应用”。"

#. placeholders: {control_status}
msgid ""
"Open driving status with {control_status}, then choose Driver apps. Up and "
"Down choose an app; Enter opens it. Escape returns."
msgstr "用{control_status}打开驾驶状态，然后选择“司机应用”。Up和Down选择一个应用；Enter打开。Escape返回。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Up and Down choose an app; Enter opens it."
msgstr "Up和Down选择一个应用；Enter打开。"

msgid ""
"In a report, Up and Down move through the information and Enter repeats "
"what you selected. Escape returns to Driver apps, then to driving status."
msgstr "在报告里，Up和Down浏览信息，Enter重复你选中的内容。Escape返回“司机应用”，再按返回驾驶状态。"

msgid ""
"Radio lets you switch the radio on or off, tune, manage favorites, and "
"suggest a station. Search by part of a name, call sign, or format, then "
"choose a result. Out-of-range stations cannot be tuned here."
msgstr ""
"“电台”让你打开或关闭收音机、调台、管理收藏，以及推荐电台。可以按名称的一部分、呼号或节目类型搜索，然后选择一个结果。超出范围的电台在这里无法调到。"

msgid ""
"Navigation reviews your next guidance, progress, and next listed exit. Map "
"under driving status gives a broader view of the route and stops."
msgstr "“导航”可以查看你的下一条引导、进度和下一个列出的出口。驾驶状态里的“地图”能更全面地查看路线和停靠点。"

msgid ""
"Weather gives conditions, suggested safe speed, how old the report is, and "
"any active live weather alerts. Simulated weather includes a forecast; a "
"live report may not. The app tells you if a live check is updating or has "
"failed."
msgstr ""
"“天气”给出路况天气、建议的安全车速、报告是多久以前的，以及当前所有实时天气警报。模拟天气包含预报；实时报告可能没有。如果实时查询正在更新或失败了，应用"
"会告诉你。"

msgid ""
"Traffic reports traffic ahead, including a reported vehicle's distance and "
"speed. No reported pinch in the next twenty miles does not guarantee an "
"empty road."
msgstr "“车流”报告前方的车流，包括被报告车辆的距离和速度。接下来20英里内没有报告拥堵，并不保证道路空无一车。"

msgid ""
"Truck stops lists up to three route stops in the next hundred miles, with "
"distance and services. Check for fuel, repairs, and parking before choosing "
"a stop."
msgstr "“卡车服务站”列出接下来100英里内最多三个路线停靠点，并说明距离和服务。选择停靠点前，先看看有没有燃油、维修和停车位。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Enforcement reports are quiet in hours modes without enforcement."
msgstr "在没有执法的工时模式下，执法报告保持安静。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Road chatter gives informal driver reports that may be stale."
msgstr "“沿途见闻”提供司机们非正式的报告，可能已经过时。"

#. placeholders: {control_cb}
msgid ""
"Road chatter gives informal driver reports that may be stale. Enforcement "
"reports are quiet in hours modes without enforcement. {control_cb} repeats "
"the last chatter with its distance updated."
msgstr ""
"“沿途见闻”提供司机们非正式的报告，可能已经过时。在没有执法的工时模式下，执法报告保持安静。{control_cb}重复最近一条闲聊，并更新它的距离。"

#. placeholders: {control_cb}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_cb} repeats the last chatter with its distance updated."
msgstr "{control_cb}重复最近一条闲聊，并更新它的距离。"

msgid ""
"ELD gives your hours and guidance about reachable legal rest. Check again "
"if traffic or weather slows your trip."
msgstr "ELD给出你的工时，以及关于能到达的合法休息地点的建议。如果车流或天气拖慢了你的行程，再查一次。"

msgid "Radio and playlists"
msgstr "电台和播放列表"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Page Down or apostrophe tunes forward; Page Up or semicolon tunes backward."
msgstr "Page Down或单引号向前调台；Page Up或分号向后调台。"

#. placeholders: {control_radio}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"With the engine running, {control_radio} switches the radio on or off."
msgstr "发动机运转时，{control_radio}打开或关闭收音机。"

#. placeholders: {control_radio}
msgid ""
"With the engine running, {control_radio} switches the radio on or off. Page "
"Down or apostrophe tunes forward; Page Up or semicolon tunes backward."
msgstr "发动机运转时，{control_radio}打开或关闭收音机。Page Down或单引号向前调台；Page Up或分号向后调台。"

msgid ""
"Hold Control with a tune key to jump between categories, including route "
"music, Freight Fate stations, your playlists, favorites, and broadcast or "
"web stations."
msgstr "按住Control再按调台键，可以在类别之间跳转，包括沿途音乐、Freight Fate电台、你的播放列表、收藏，以及广播或网络电台。"

msgid ""
"Hold Shift to change volume in ten percent steps: Page Up or semicolon "
"raises it, Page Down or apostrophe lowers it."
msgstr "按住Shift以百分之10为一档调音量：Page Up或分号调高，Page Down或单引号调低。"

#. placeholders: {control_radio_favorite}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_radio_favorite} saves or removes a favorite."
msgstr "{control_radio_favorite}保存或移除收藏。"

#. placeholders: {control_radio_favorite}, {control_radio_status}, {control_radio_now_playing}
msgid ""
"{control_radio_favorite} saves or removes a favorite. "
"{control_radio_status} reads station, reception, volume, and streamer-safe "
"status. {control_radio_now_playing} reads available song information."
msgstr ""
"{control_radio_favorite}保存或移除收藏。{control_radio_status}读出电台、信号、音量和直播安全状态。{con"
"trol_radio_now_playing}读出可用的歌曲信息。"

#. placeholders: {control_radio_now_playing}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_radio_now_playing} reads available song information."
msgstr "{control_radio_now_playing}读出可用的歌曲信息。"

#. placeholders: {control_radio_status}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{control_radio_status} reads station, reception, volume, and streamer-safe "
"status."
msgstr "{control_radio_status}读出电台、信号、音量和直播安全状态。"

msgid ""
"Radio status lists receivable stations. Use the Radio app to choose or "
"search for a station and browse favorites."
msgstr "电台状态会列出能收到的电台。用“电台”应用选择或搜索电台，以及浏览收藏。"

msgid ""
"Regional stations fade as you leave their range. Favorites play from "
"anywhere and never fade. If reception fails, the radio tries a clear local "
"station, then a fallback. Failed streams leave the dial for that session. "
"Roadhouse and Night Line are available across the map."
msgstr ""
"离开覆盖范围时，地区电台会逐渐消失。收藏的电台在任何地方都能播放，也不会消失。如果信号断了，收音机会先找一个清晰的本地电台，再换备用电台。播放失败的网络"
"电台在本次游戏中会从频道中移除。Roadhouse和Night Line在整张地图上都能收到。"

msgid ""
"Put M3U, M3U8, or PLS playlists in the Playlists folder inside your saves "
"folder. Radio status tells you the folder location and reloads it when "
"opened. Entries can be audio files, network paths, or stream addresses."
msgstr ""
"把M3U、M3U8或PLS播放列表放进存档文件夹里的Playlists文件夹。电台状态会告诉你这个文件夹的位置，并在打开时重新载入。条目可以是音频文件、"
"网络路径或流地址。"

msgid ""
"Personal playlists normally play in order and resume where you left them. "
"Shuffle plays every track once in a random order, then chooses a new order. "
"Unreadable entries are skipped."
msgstr ""
"个人播放列表通常按顺序播放，并从你上次离开的地方继续。随机播放会按随机顺序把每首歌都播一遍，然后换一个新的顺序。无法读取的条目会被跳过。"

msgid ""
"Original music uses licensed menu and Roadhouse tracks. Synthesized uses "
"music the game composes and the original three tracks, removing fictional "
"regional stations and voiced breaks. Real streams and personal playlists "
"remain unless streamer-safe mode hides them."
msgstr ""
"“原版”音乐使用授权的菜单和Roadhouse曲目。“合成”使用游戏自己作的曲子和三首原版曲目，并移除虚构的地区电台和有人声的插播。真实的网络电台和个人"
"播放列表仍然保留，除非直播安全模式把它们隐藏。"

msgid ""
"Streamer-safe mode keeps built-in safe stations. With Synthesized music, "
"only the synthesized Roadhouse remains. Radio power, volume, and now "
"playing still work; other station controls do nothing."
msgstr ""
"直播安全模式只保留内置的安全电台。音乐设为“合成”时，只剩下合成的Roadhouse。收音机开关、音量和正在播放仍然有效；其他电台控制不起作用。"

msgid ""
"Suggest a station in the Radio app asks for its type, name, and stream "
"address. AM and FM suggestions also need a call sign and state. City and "
"frequency are optional. Connect an account and enable Online services first."
msgstr ""
"“电台”应用里的“推荐电台”会询问电台的类型、名称和流地址。AM和FM电台的推荐还需要呼号和州。城市和频率可选。请先连接账户并打开在线服务。"

msgid ""
"Suggestions are checked for playback and duplicates before review. Accepted "
"stations can appear at a later launch without a game update."
msgstr "推荐的电台在审核前会检查能否播放以及是否重复。被采纳的电台可能在以后启动游戏时出现，不需要更新游戏。"

msgid "Settings and accessibility"
msgstr "设置和无障碍"

msgid ""
"Settings save as you change them. Choose a setting with Up or Down, then "
"Right or Enter for its next value, or Left for the previous value."
msgstr "设置在你更改时就会保存。用Up或Down选择一个设置，然后用Right或Enter切换到下一个值，或用Left切换到上一个值。"

msgid ""
"Gameplay holds driving assistance, difficulty and hours, world and traffic, "
"and controls. Audio, Speech, Updates, Problem reports, and Online have "
"separate choices where supported. F1 explains the selected setting."
msgstr ""
"“游戏玩法”包括驾驶辅助、难度与工时、世界与车流，以及操作。“音频”、“语音”、“更新”、“问题报告”和“在线”在支持的地方有各自的选项。F1解释当前选"
"中的设置。"

msgid ""
"Realistic leaves lane keeping off. Balanced adds partial lane keeping and "
"facility stops. All assists adds full lane keeping and a fifty-five mile "
"per hour descent ceiling. Adjusting assistance yourself changes the preset "
"name to Custom."
msgstr ""
"写实会把车道保持关闭。均衡加上部分车道保持和厂区停车。全部辅助加上完全车道保持，以及每小时55英里的下坡车速上限。自己调整辅助会让预设名称变成自定义。"

msgid ""
"Presets leave driving pace, legal hours, transmission, world sources, "
"latching brake, and cue volumes as they are."
msgstr "预设不会改变驾驶节奏、法定工时、变速箱、世界数据来源、锁定刹车和提示音量。"

msgid ""
"Relaxed pacing passes about ten minutes of road and clock each real minute, "
"with more response time and gentler consequences. Standard moves twice as "
"fast. Real time follows the computer clock at real speed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Change pacing mid-drive from pause; it begins when the truck next stops. "
"Legal hours and time remaining on a deadline stay intact."
msgstr "驾驶中可以从暂停菜单更改节奏；它在卡车下一次停下时开始生效。法定工时和截止时间前的剩余时间都不受影响。"

msgid ""
"Choose simulated or available live weather, traffic, and parking separately "
"from online sharing. Fuel prices can use the weekly national diesel average "
"with regional differences or simulated regional prices."
msgstr ""
"天气、车流和停车可以分别选择模拟数据或可用的实时数据，与在线分享无关。燃油价格可以使用每周全国柴油平均价加上地区差价，也可以使用模拟的地区价格。"

msgid ""
"Adjust music, radio, engine, weather, and gameplay cues separately if one "
"covers another. Game sounds step back for speech lowers engine, weather, "
"and radio to half volume while the road voice speaks."
msgstr ""
"如果某个声音盖过了另一个，可以分别调整音乐、收音机、发动机、天气和游戏提示的音量。“语音播报时降低游戏声音”会在道路语音说话时把发动机、天气和收音机降到"
"一半音量。"

msgid ""
"Driving speech chooses Standard, Quiet, or Urgent only announcements. "
"Readout keys still answer when asked. Place names and roadside chatter have "
"separate controls."
msgstr "驾驶播报可以选择标准、安静或仅紧急。你主动查询时，查询键仍然会回答。地名和沿途见闻有各自的控制项。"

msgid ""
"Speech and braille sends messages to both. Braille only requires NVDA or "
"JAWS; speech returns if the screen reader closes. You can also choose a "
"separate driving event voice."
msgstr "“语音和盲文”把消息同时发送到两者。“仅盲文”需要NVDA或JAWS；屏幕阅读器关闭时会恢复语音。你还可以选择单独的驾驶事件语音。"

msgid ""
"For a problem report, use Where the game log is saved to find the session "
"record, including spoken messages. It stays on your computer unless you "
"share it."
msgstr "报告问题时，用“游戏日志保存位置”找到这次游戏的记录，其中包括说出的消息。除非你分享，否则它只留在你的电脑上。"

msgid "Online sharing and backups"
msgstr "在线分享和备份"

msgid ""
"Online lets you browse driver profiles and account achievements, connect an "
"account, choose sharing, and manage private backups. Viewing drivers shares "
"nothing about you."
msgstr "“在线”让你浏览司机主页和账户成就、连接账户、选择分享内容，以及管理私人备份。查看其他司机不会分享你的任何信息。"

msgid ""
"Drivers on duty refreshes about once a minute. Enter opens a driver's "
"public profile. Driver directory includes drivers who are not currently "
"playing; Check again refreshes it."
msgstr "“在岗司机”大约每分钟刷新一次。Enter打开某位司机的公开主页。“司机名录”包括当前没在玩的司机；“再查一次”会刷新它。"

msgid ""
"Use an activation code in your browser to connect an existing account and "
"enable profile sharing and backup. You can turn either off afterward."
msgstr "在浏览器里使用激活码来连接现有账户，并开启主页分享和备份。之后你可以关闭其中任何一项。"

msgid ""
"Profile sharing includes your activity, achievements, and road journal. "
"Public profiles omit current cash, full saves, coordinates, and precise "
"location. Career statistics need an accepted private backup."
msgstr "主页分享包括你的动态、成就和行车日志。公开主页不包含当前现金、完整存档、坐标和精确位置。职业统计需要一个已被接受的私人备份。"

msgid ""
"Cloud backup keeps ten accepted revisions per career and up to ten careers. "
"Restore checks the signed backup and keeps the replaced local save as a "
"fallback. Back up this career now uploads immediately."
msgstr ""
"云备份为每段职业生涯保留10个已接受的版本，最多保留10段职业生涯。恢复时会检查带签名的备份，并把被替换的本地存档留作备用。“现在备份这段职业生涯”会立"
"即上传。"

msgid "Discord shows broad activity and clears it after half an hour idle."
msgstr "Discord会显示大致活动，闲置半小时后自动清除。"

msgid ""
"Online services switches sharing services off together while remembering "
"your choices. Live weather, traffic, and parking keep their separate "
"settings."
msgstr "“在线服务”会一起关闭所有分享服务，同时记住你的选择。实时天气、车流和停车保留各自的设置。"

msgid "Common questions"
msgstr "常见问题"

msgid ""
"Do I have to buy a truck? No. The carrier assigns company drivers a truck "
"and pays its fuel, repairs, and insurance. Buying trucks opens with the "
"owner-operator buy-in from level 18; Business status lists what else it "
"needs."
msgstr ""
"我必须买卡车吗？不用。承运商会给公司司机分配卡车，并支付它的燃油、维修和保险。买卡车从18级的车主司机买断开始；“经营状况”会列出还需要什么。"

msgid ""
"What are the fleets on Career stats? Each is a set of carrier trucks that "
"dispatch assigns by level: the yard standard, then the regional fleet at "
"level 4, the long-haul fleet at 9, the premium fleet at 13, and first pick "
"of the yard at 17. Moving up costs you nothing."
msgstr ""
"“职业统计”里的车队是什么？每个车队是一组承运商卡车，调度按等级分配：先是场院的标准车，4级起是地区车队，9级起是长途车队，13级起是高级车队，17级起"
"可以在场院里优先挑选。升级不花你一分钱。"

msgid ""
"Why am I in a different truck on some loads? Until level 9, dispatch "
"matches a spare truck to each load. From level 9 you keep one truck for "
"every load until dispatch moves you up to the next fleet."
msgstr ""
"为什么有些货物我开的是另一辆卡车？在9级之前，调度会给每单货物配一辆空闲的卡车。从9级开始，你每单货物都开同一辆卡车，直到调度把你升到下一个车队。"

msgid ""
"Why am I not in the truck my level earns? Low dispatch trust, a suspended "
"CDL, debt, or your driving record can hold equipment back. Career stats "
"names the reason and what brings the truck back."
msgstr ""
"为什么我没开上我的等级该有的卡车？调度信任度低、CDL被暂扣、债务或你的驾驶记录都可能让设备被压着。“职业统计”会说明原因，以及怎样才能拿回那辆卡车。"

msgid ""
"What is the difference between reputation and dispatch trust? Reputation is "
"a score from your deliveries, lowered by your driving record: Outstanding, "
"Well regarded, Established, Unproven, Shaky, Damaged, or Ruined. New "
"drivers start at 50, Unproven. A trust line shows it as, for example, "
"Dispatch trust: full. Reputation 85 out of 100. Dispatch trust is what the "
"carrier lets you do right now; your CDL, your record, and what you owe "
"count toward it too. Settings, Speech has Score display: both, percentage "
"only, or description only."
msgstr ""
"声誉和调度信任度有什么区别？声誉是根据你的送货情况得出的分数，会因你的驾驶记录而降低：出色、口碑良好、稳固、有待证明、不稳、受损或败坏。新司机从50开始"
"，也就是有待证明。信任度播报会这样读，例如：调度信任度：完全。声誉85，满分100。调度信任度是承运商现在允许你做什么；你的CDL、你的记录和你欠的钱也"
"都算在内。设置、语音里有分数显示：两者、仅百分比或仅描述。"

msgid ""
"Why can I not accept a load? It may need a certificate, endorsement, or "
"trailer you do not have. F1 on the load reads its requirements, and "
"Licenses and training offers the courses."
msgstr "为什么我不能接受某单货物？它可能需要你还没有的培训证书、驾照签注或挂车。在货物上按F1会读出它的要求，“驾照与培训”提供相应的课程。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Open weigh station ahead means every truck must pull in."
msgstr "前方称重站开放，意味着每辆卡车都必须驶入。"

#. placeholders: {control_take_exit}, {control_rest}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Signal with {control_take_exit}, stop at the scale, then press "
"{control_rest} to check in."
msgstr "用{control_take_exit}打转向灯，在称重站停下，然后按{control_rest}登记。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Why did I get a citation at a weigh station?"
msgstr "为什么我在称重站吃了罚单？"

#. placeholders: {control_take_exit}, {control_rest}
msgid ""
"Why did I get a citation at a weigh station? Open weigh station ahead means "
"every truck must pull in. Signal with {control_take_exit}, stop at the "
"scale, then press {control_rest} to check in."
msgstr ""
"为什么我在称重站吃了罚单？前方称重站开放，意味着每辆卡车都必须驶入。用{control_take_exit}打转向灯，在称重站停下，然后按{contro"
"l_rest}登记。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Some states hold trucks below the car limit."
msgstr "有些州规定卡车的限速低于小汽车。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Why is the limit 55 on a fast highway?"
msgstr "为什么在快速公路上限速是55？"

#. placeholders: {control_speed_limit}
msgid ""
"Why is the limit 55 on a fast highway? Some states hold trucks below the "
"car limit. {control_speed_limit} names the state when it does."
msgstr "为什么在快速公路上限速是55？有些州规定卡车的限速低于小汽车。遇到这种情况，{control_speed_limit}会说出是哪个州。"

#. placeholders: {control_speed_limit}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_speed_limit} names the state when it does."
msgstr "遇到这种情况，{control_speed_limit}会说出是哪个州。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "I missed my exit."
msgstr "我错过了出口。"

#. placeholders: {control_route}
msgid ""
"I missed my exit. What now? Keep driving and follow the turnaround "
"guidance. {control_route} reads the distance left."
msgstr "我错过了出口。现在怎么办？继续开，按掉头引导走。{control_route}读出剩余距离。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Keep driving and follow the turnaround guidance."
msgstr "继续开，按掉头引导走。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "What now?"
msgstr "现在怎么办？"

#. placeholders: {control_route}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{control_route} reads the distance left."
msgstr "{control_route}读出剩余距离。"

msgid ""
"The truck will not move. What should I check? Fuel, the engine, air "
"pressure, and the parking brake. Damage, worn parts, or a suspended CDL can "
"also stop you."
msgstr "卡车不动了。我该检查什么？燃油、发动机、气压和驻车制动。损坏、磨损的部件或被暂扣的CDL也可能让你走不了。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "How do I know when a hill ends?"
msgstr "怎么知道坡什么时候结束？"

#. placeholders: {control_grade}
msgid ""
"How do I know when a hill ends? {control_grade} reads the grade under the "
"wheels and the next one worth planning for."
msgstr "怎么知道坡什么时候结束？{control_grade}读出车轮下的坡道，以及下一个值得提前准备的坡道。"

#. placeholders: {control_grade}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{control_grade} reads the grade under the wheels and the next one worth "
"planning for."
msgstr "{control_grade}读出车轮下的坡道，以及下一个值得提前准备的坡道。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "How do I change stations or play my own music?"
msgstr "怎么换电台或播放我自己的音乐？"

#. placeholders: {control_radio}
msgid ""
"How do I change stations or play my own music? With the engine running, "
"{control_radio} switches the radio on, and Page Up or Page Down tunes. Put "
"playlist files in the Playlists folder inside your saves folder; Radio "
"status says where it is."
msgstr ""
"怎么换电台或播放我自己的音乐？发动机运转时，{control_radio}打开收音机，Page Up或Page "
"Down调台。把播放列表文件放进存档文件夹里的Playlists文件夹；电台状态会说出它在哪里。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Put playlist files in the Playlists folder inside your saves folder; Radio "
"status says where it is."
msgstr "把播放列表文件放进存档文件夹里的Playlists文件夹；电台状态会说出它在哪里。"

#. placeholders: {control_radio}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"With the engine running, {control_radio} switches the radio on, and Page Up "
"or Page Down tunes."
msgstr "发动机运转时，{control_radio}打开收音机，Page Up或Page Down调台。"

msgid ""
"Can I hear a weather warning again? With live weather on, the Weather app "
"under Driver apps lists active alerts. Comma also steps back through recent "
"messages."
msgstr "天气警报能再听一遍吗？开启实时天气时，“司机应用”里的“天气”应用会列出当前的警报。逗号也可以往回翻看最近的消息。"

msgid ""
"Can I steer myself? Yes. Choose the Realistic preset, or set lane keeping "
"to off, under Settings, Gameplay, Driving assistance."
msgstr "我能自己转向吗？能。在设置、游戏玩法、驾驶辅助里选择写实预设，或把车道保持设为关闭。"

msgid ""
"Can I play in braille only? Set Output to braille only under Settings, "
"Speech. It needs NVDA or JAWS."
msgstr "能只用盲文玩吗？在设置、语音里把输出设为仅盲文。它需要NVDA或JAWS。"

msgid "Controller"
msgstr "手柄"

msgid ""
"Controllers work alongside the keyboard. Button names use the Xbox layout. "
"Settings, Gameplay, Controls lets you change eligible assignments."
msgstr "手柄和键盘可以一起用。按键名称采用Xbox布局。在设置、游戏玩法、操作里可以更改可调整的按键分配。"

msgid ""
"On newer Xbox controllers, Back is the View button, left of the Xbox "
"button, and Start is the Menu button on its right. On Windows, the Xbox "
"button opens the Game Bar; press it again to return."
msgstr ""
"在较新的 Xbox 手柄上，Back 是 Xbox 键左边的视图键，Start 是它右边的菜单键。在 Windows 上，Xbox 键会打开 Game "
"Bar；再按一次即可返回。"

msgid ""
"In menus, D-pad moves, A confirms, B returns, and Back reads help. During "
"driving speech, Back stops the voice; otherwise it reads help. Start pauses."
msgstr "在菜单中，D-pad移动，A确认，B返回，Back读出帮助。驾驶播报说话时，Back停止语音；其他时候它读出帮助。Start暂停。"

msgid ""
"Right trigger accelerates, left trigger brakes, and fully pressing the left "
"trigger gives emergency braking. The left stick steers; with lane keeping "
"on full, push it left or right to change one lane."
msgstr ""
"Right trigger 加速，Left trigger 刹车，将 Left trigger 按到底则紧急制动。Left stick "
"控制转向；车道保持为完全时，向左或向右推一下即可变换一条车道。"

msgid ""
"To reverse in automatic, stop, release the left trigger, then press and "
"hold it again. Use a fresh right-trigger hold at a standstill for forward."
msgstr "自动挡倒车时，先停下，松开左扳机，然后再按住它。停稳后重新按住右扳机即可前进。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Hold left bumper for manual clutch."
msgstr "按住left bumper使用手动离合。"

#. placeholders: {pad_shift_up}, {pad_shift_down}, {pad_cruise}, {pad_speed}
msgid ""
"Hold left bumper for manual clutch. {pad_shift_up} shifts up and "
"{pad_shift_down} down, past first into neutral and then reverse. "
"{pad_cruise} starts speed control; {pad_speed} reads speed."
msgstr ""
"按住 left bumper 作为手动离合器。{pad_shift_up} 升挡，{pad_shift_down} "
"降挡，降过一挡进入空挡，再到倒挡。{pad_cruise} 启动速度控制；{pad_speed} 报出车速。"

#. placeholders: {pad_cruise}, {pad_speed}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{pad_cruise} starts speed control; {pad_speed} reads speed."
msgstr "{pad_cruise}启动速度控制；{pad_speed}读出车速。"

#. placeholders: {pad_shift_up}, {pad_shift_down}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{pad_shift_up} shifts up and {pad_shift_down} down, past first into neutral "
"and then reverse."
msgstr "{pad_shift_up} 升挡，{pad_shift_down} 降挡，降过一挡进入空挡，再到倒挡。"

#. placeholders: {pad_horn}, {pad_engine_brake}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{pad_horn} sounds the horn; {pad_engine_brake} enables the engine brake."
msgstr "{pad_horn}鸣喇叭；{pad_engine_brake}开启发动机制动。"

#. placeholders: {pad_horn}, {pad_engine_brake}, {pad_route}, {pad_weather}, {pad_clock}
msgid ""
"{pad_horn} sounds the horn; {pad_engine_brake} enables the engine brake. "
"{pad_route} reads location, {pad_weather} weather, and {pad_clock} clock "
"and hours."
msgstr ""
"{pad_horn}鸣喇叭；{pad_engine_brake}开启发动机制动。{pad_route}读出位置，{pad_weather}读出天气，{p"
"ad_clock}读出时钟和工时。"

#. placeholders: {pad_route}, {pad_weather}, {pad_clock}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{pad_route} reads location, {pad_weather} weather, and {pad_clock} clock "
"and hours."
msgstr "{pad_route}读出位置，{pad_weather}读出天气，{pad_clock}读出时钟和工时。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Right bumper accesses the second layer."
msgstr "right bumper进入第二层。"

#. placeholders: {pad_engine}, {pad_fuel}, {pad_speed_limit}
msgid ""
"Right bumper accesses the second layer. {pad_engine} controls the engine, "
"{pad_fuel} reads fuel, and {pad_speed_limit} reads the limit."
msgstr ""
"right bumper进入第二层。{pad_engine}控制发动机，{pad_fuel}读出燃油，{pad_speed_limit}读出限速。"

#. placeholders: {pad_engine}, {pad_fuel}, {pad_speed_limit}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{pad_engine} controls the engine, {pad_fuel} reads fuel, and "
"{pad_speed_limit} reads the limit."
msgstr "{pad_engine}控制发动机，{pad_fuel}读出燃油，{pad_speed_limit}读出限速。"

#. placeholders: {pad_parking_brake}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{pad_parking_brake} controls the parking brake."
msgstr "{pad_parking_brake}控制驻车制动。"

#. placeholders: {pad_parking_brake}, {pad_take_exit}, {pad_rest}
msgid ""
"{pad_parking_brake} controls the parking brake. {pad_take_exit} signals for "
"an exit; {pad_rest} opens route-stop actions or emergency shoulder sleep "
"when fully stopped."
msgstr ""
"{pad_parking_brake}控制驻车制动。{pad_take_exit}为出口打转向灯；完全停下时，{pad_rest}打开路线停靠点的操作或"
"紧急路肩睡觉。"

#. placeholders: {pad_take_exit}, {pad_rest}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{pad_take_exit} signals for an exit; {pad_rest} opens route-stop actions or "
"emergency shoulder sleep when fully stopped."
msgstr "{pad_take_exit}为出口打转向灯；完全停下时，{pad_rest}打开路线停靠点的操作或紧急路肩睡觉。"

#. placeholders: {pad_cruise_down}, {pad_cruise_up}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{pad_cruise_down} and {pad_cruise_up} change the cruise target."
msgstr "{pad_cruise_down}和{pad_cruise_up}更改巡航目标速度。"

#. placeholders: {pad_cruise_down}, {pad_cruise_up}, {pad_status}
msgid ""
"{pad_cruise_down} and {pad_cruise_up} change the cruise target. "
"{pad_status} opens driving status, where Driving commands lists every "
"command, including those with no button."
msgstr ""
"{pad_cruise_down} 和 {pad_cruise_up} 调整巡航目标。{pad_status} "
"打开驾驶状态，其中的驾驶命令列出所有命令，包括没有按钮的命令。"

#. placeholders: {pad_status}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{pad_status} opens driving status, where Driving commands lists every "
"command, including those with no button."
msgstr "{pad_status} 打开驾驶状态，其中的驾驶命令列出所有命令，包括没有按钮的命令。"

#. placeholders: {pad_radio_tune_prev}, {pad_radio_tune_next}, {pad_radio_volume_down}, {pad_radio_volume_up}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{pad_radio_tune_prev} and {pad_radio_tune_next} tune the radio, and "
"{pad_radio_volume_down} and {pad_radio_volume_up} change its volume."
msgstr ""
"{pad_radio_tune_prev} 和 {pad_radio_tune_next} 调换电台，{pad_radio_volume_down} "
"和 {pad_radio_volume_up} 调节音量。"

#. placeholders: {pad_radio_tune_prev}, {pad_radio_tune_next}, {pad_radio_volume_down}, {pad_radio_volume_up}, {pad_radio}
msgid ""
"{pad_radio_tune_prev} and {pad_radio_tune_next} tune the radio, and "
"{pad_radio_volume_down} and {pad_radio_volume_up} change its volume. "
"{pad_radio} turns it on or off."
msgstr ""
"{pad_radio_tune_prev} 和 {pad_radio_tune_next} 调换电台，{pad_radio_volume_down} "
"和 {pad_radio_volume_up} 调节音量。{pad_radio} 打开或关闭电台。"

#. placeholders: {pad_radio}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{pad_radio} turns it on or off."
msgstr "{pad_radio} 打开或关闭电台。"

msgid ""
"To learn the buttons, hold Back and press Start on any screen. Each button "
"you press says what it does; Start twice leaves."
msgstr "要学习按钮，可在任何界面按住 Back 再按 Start。按下的每个按钮都会说出它的作用；按两次 Start 退出。"

msgid ""
"If the controller does nothing, check that Controller is enabled under "
"Settings, Gameplay, Controls. The game uses the first controller it finds, "
"so unplug other controllers and close Steam. If the Xbox button opens Steam "
"Big Picture, press B to close it."
msgstr ""
"如果手柄没有反应，请检查 设置、游戏玩法、操作 中的手柄是否已启用。游戏使用找到的第一个手柄，所以请拔掉其他手柄并关闭 Steam。如果 Xbox "
"按钮打开了 Steam Big Picture，按 B 将其关闭。"

msgid "pad"
msgstr "pad"

#. placeholders: {page}, {HELP_PAGES}, {title}
msgid "Page {page} of {HELP_PAGES}: {title}."
msgstr "第{page}页，共{HELP_PAGES}页：{title}。"

msgid ""
"D-pad Left and Right change pages, Up and Down let you read a little at a "
"time. A reads the whole page, Back stops speech, and B goes back."
msgstr "D-pad的Left和Right翻页，Up和Down让你一次读一小段。A朗读整页，Back停止朗读，B返回。"

msgid ""
"Left and Right arrows or Page Up and Page Down change pages. Up and Down "
"let you read a little at a time. Enter or Space reads the whole page, "
"either Control or F1 stops speech, and Escape goes back."
msgstr ""
"Left和Right方向键或Page Up和Page "
"Down翻页。Up和Down让你一次读一小段。Enter或Space朗读整页，任意一个Control键或F1停止朗读，Escape返回。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "How to play."
msgstr "玩法说明。"

#. placeholders: {controls}, {page_title}
msgid "How to play. {controls} {page_title}"
msgstr "玩法说明。{controls}{page_title}"

#. placeholders: {title}, {page}, {HELP_PAGES}
msgid "How to play - {title} ({page}/{HELP_PAGES})"
msgstr "玩法说明：{title}，第{page}页，共{HELP_PAGES}页"

msgid ""
"Enter opens an item or changes a setting forward, Right also forward, Left "
"backward. Escape goes back. Drivers on duty, the Driver directory, the duty "
"notices, and Account achievements work without connecting. The rest waits "
"for an orinks.net account, and everything you share can be turned off again."
msgstr ""
"Enter打开一项或向前更改设置，Right也是向前，Left向后。Escape返回。“在岗司机”、“司机名录”、上下班通知和“账户成就”不连接也能用。"
"其他功能需要orinks.net账户，而且你分享的一切都可以再关掉。"

msgid ""
"Your profile needs your orinks.net account. Choose Set up orinks.net "
"account first."
msgstr "你的主页需要orinks.net账户。请先选择“设置orinks.net账户”。"

msgid "The browser could not be opened. The address is on your clipboard."
msgstr "无法打开浏览器。网址已复制到剪贴板。"

#. placeholders: {url}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Go to {url} in any browser."
msgstr "请在任意浏览器中前往{url}。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"The browser could not be opened and the clipboard did not take the address."
msgstr "无法打开浏览器，网址也没能复制到剪贴板。"

#. placeholders: {url}
msgid ""
"The browser could not be opened and the clipboard did not take the address. "
"Go to {url} in any browser."
msgstr "无法打开浏览器，网址也没能复制到剪贴板。请在任意浏览器中前往{url}。"

msgid " The address is also on your clipboard."
msgstr " 网址也已复制到剪贴板。"

#. placeholders: {clipboard_note}
msgid "Opening your driver setup page in your browser.{clipboard_note}"
msgstr "正在浏览器中打开你的司机设置页面。{clipboard_note}"

msgid ""
"Cloud backup needs your orinks.net account. Choose Set up orinks.net "
"account first."
msgstr "云备份需要orinks.net账户。请先选择“设置orinks.net账户”。"

msgid "Restore a cloud backup"
msgstr "恢复云备份"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Restore a cloud backup."
msgstr "恢复云备份。"

#. placeholders: {waiting}
msgid ""
"Restore a cloud backup. {waiting} is waiting for you to choose which copy "
"to keep"
msgstr "恢复云备份。{waiting}正在等你选择保留哪一份"

#. placeholders: {waiting}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{waiting} is waiting for you to choose which copy to keep"
msgstr "{waiting}正在等你选择保留哪一份"

#. placeholders: {waiting}
msgid ""
"Restore a cloud backup. {waiting} careers are waiting for you to choose "
"which copy to keep"
msgstr "恢复云备份。有{waiting}段职业生涯正在等你选择保留哪一份"

#. placeholders: {waiting}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{waiting} careers are waiting for you to choose which copy to keep"
msgstr "有{waiting}段职业生涯正在等你选择保留哪一份"

msgid ""
"The careers backed up to your orinks.net account, to bring one onto this "
"computer."
msgstr "备份在你orinks.net账户里的职业生涯，可以把其中一段放到这台电脑上。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"A career here changed on another computer, and it is not backing up at all "
"until you pick."
msgstr "这里有一段职业生涯在另一台电脑上被改动了，在你做出选择之前，它完全不会备份。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Choosing this computer's save keeps what you have played and sends it up; "
"nothing is overwritten until you choose."
msgstr "选择这台电脑的存档，会保留你玩过的内容并上传；在你选择之前，什么都不会被覆盖。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Open this to choose which copy to keep."
msgstr "打开这一项来选择保留哪一份。"

#. placeholders: {base}
msgid ""
"Open this to choose which copy to keep. A career here changed on another "
"computer, and it is not backing up at all until you pick. Choosing this "
"computer's save keeps what you have played and sends it up; nothing is "
"overwritten until you choose. {base}"
msgstr ""
"打开这一项来选择保留哪一份。这里有一段职业生涯在另一台电脑上被改动了，在你做出选择之前，它完全不会备份。选择这台电脑的存档，会保留你玩过的内容并上传；在"
"你选择之前，什么都不会被覆盖。{base}"

msgid "Driver directory"
msgstr "司机名录"

msgid ""
"Every driver with a public profile, on duty or not, and when each was last "
"on duty. Enter on a driver reads their profile. Viewing it shares nothing "
"about you."
msgstr "每一位有公开主页的司机，无论是否在岗，以及每人最后一次在岗的时间。在一位司机上按Enter会读出他的主页。查看不会分享你的任何信息。"

#. placeholders: {on_off}
msgid "Say when drivers go on or off duty: {on_off}"
msgstr "司机上下班时提示：{on_off}"

msgid ""
"Says when another driver goes on or off duty, like Road Star is on duty, "
"anywhere in the game. Checks the public drivers list about once a minute, "
"needs no account, and shares nothing about you."
msgstr ""
"当其他司机上班或下班时提示你，比如“Road "
"Star正在岗”，在游戏中任何地方都会提示。大约每分钟检查一次公开的司机列表，不需要账户，也不会分享你的任何信息。"

msgid ""
"Achievements earned across every career on this installation. The main "
"menu's Achievements is per career."
msgstr "在这次安装中所有职业生涯里获得的成就。主菜单里的“成就”是按职业生涯分开的。"

msgid "Your profile"
msgstr "你的主页"

msgid ""
"Your public driver profile, read the way any player hears it from the "
"drivers list. Needs your orinks.net account and Profile sharing on."
msgstr "你的公开司机主页，读法和任何玩家从司机列表里听到的一样。需要orinks.net账户并开启主页分享。"

#. placeholders: {on_off}
msgid "Online services: {on_off}"
msgstr "在线服务：{on_off}"

msgid ""
"Master switch for the orinks.net and sharing services. Off stops the "
"drivers list, profile sharing, cloud backup, station suggestions, and "
"Discord presence without losing their settings. Live weather, traffic, and "
"parking have their own toggles under Settings."
msgstr ""
"orinks.net及共享服务的总开关。关闭后会停止在岗司机列表、主页共享、云备份、电台推荐和Discord状态，但不会丢失相关设置。实时天气、车流和停"
"车信息可在“设置”中分别开关。"

msgid "orinks.net account: connected"
msgstr "orinks.net账户：已连接"

msgid "Set up orinks.net account"
msgstr "设置orinks.net账户"

msgid ""
"Connects the game to your orinks.net account, which turns Profile sharing "
"on and starts backing your careers up. Both are single items on this menu. "
"Driver name and signed-in computers are on Open my driver setup page below."
msgstr ""
"把游戏连接到你的orinks.net账户，这会开启主页分享并开始备份你的职业生涯。这两项在这个菜单上各有一项单独的开关。司机名称和已登录的电脑在下面的“"
"打开我的司机设置页面”里。"

msgid "Open my driver setup page"
msgstr "打开我的司机设置页面"

msgid ""
"Opens your orinks.net driver setup page in a browser, for your driver name, "
"profile sharing, and the computers signed in to your account."
msgstr "在浏览器中打开你的orinks.net司机设置页面，可以设置司机名称、主页分享，以及管理登录你账户的电脑。"

msgid "Profile sharing: not set up"
msgstr "主页分享：未设置"

msgid "Profile sharing: off requested"
msgstr "主页分享：已请求关闭"

#. placeholders: {on_off}
msgid "Profile sharing: {on_off}"
msgstr "主页分享：{on_off}"

msgid ""
"One public setting for your driver profile, official achievements, "
"automatic road-journal posts, the updates feed, and on-duty activity. "
"Public statistics include lifetime earnings, never the money you currently "
"have. Nothing is shared until an account is set up. Cloud backups stay "
"private."
msgstr ""
"一个公开设置，统管你的司机主页、官方成就、自动行车日志帖子、动态更新和在岗活动。公开统计包括累计收入，绝不包括你当前有多少钱。设置账户之前什么都不会分享"
"。云备份保持私密。"

#. placeholders: {on_off}
msgid "Back up saves to your orinks.net account: {on_off}"
msgstr "把存档备份到你的orinks.net账户：{on_off}"

msgid "Back up saves to your orinks.net account: not set up"
msgstr "把存档备份到你的orinks.net账户：未设置"

msgid ""
"Uploads each saved career to your orinks.net account, to restore on another "
"computer. Backups are private and never public downloads. Comes on when you "
"connect the account. Public profile statistics are read from these backups, "
"so turning this off empties them."
msgstr ""
